    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "JAZZ by the LAKE - Dixieland Jazz Event    BAND: Dixie Demons  DATE: Sunday, July 29th, 2018  EVENT:  DIXIELAND JAZZ by the LAKE #2  ADDRESS: Pop-up location in Niagara-on-the-Lake (private residence on the lake)  GETTING THERE:  Guests will take a FREE shuttle from the NOTL Community Centre.  PARKING:  FREE on site at the NOTL Community Centre.  (14 Anderson Lane, Niagara-on-the-Lake, ON)  SHUTTLE TIMES:  5:15 PM – 5:45 PM  – 6:15 PM – 6:45 PM  EVENT TIME:   7pm – 9:30pm  PRICE: $79 + HST (includes meal)"
      }
