    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Join us!  We are thrilled to be celebrating 8 years of our TWILIGHT JAZZ SERIES and moving into our 9th season.  FEATURING: Carribean Club Trio      &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    EVENT: Twilight Jazz Series: St. Catharines edition –8 Year anniversary!  DATE: Sunday,  November 3, 2019  TIME: 6 PM – 9 PM  LOCATION: Mahtay Cafe and Lounge  ADDRESS: 241 St. Paul St., St. Catharines, ON  TICKET PRICE: $15 + HST in advance / $20 + HST at the door / $10+ HST for Musicians and Arts Workers / $8 + HST for students    Buy Tickets    SEASON'S PASSES are also available:  ONLY $99 for all 8 shows    Buy Passes    Thanks to our sponsors and partners:                 &nbsp;    ARTIST BIO:    Band Members:  Laura Varela – Lead Vocals, Congas &amp; Lead Percussion  Zach Preston – Guitar and Vocals  William Preston – Bass, Clave &amp; Kick Peda    The Caribbean Club Trio is comprised of Zach Preston, Laura Varela, and Will Preston.  This trio embodies the unique musical essence of the Caribbean, featuring rhythms and music from Cuba, the Dominican Republic, Puerto Rico, Colombia, Brazil and even the occasional Jamaican reggae. It’s an old world flavor in a new package, re-imagined into a trio format, instead of a ten piece band. The band of extremely talented, multitasking musicians create a unique performance experience, with everything you hear live off the floor. The trio plays 7 days a week throughout Southern Ontario during the summer months.    The group is very excited to present their new CD at this year’s Niagara Jazz events. Entitled “GRAN VIA TROPICAL,” it was recorded in Mexico City, and features 8 original tunes which fuse groovy Afro-Caribbean rhythms with catchy choruses to make a Latin Jazz masterpiece.    With fiery guitar, deep soulful bass, driving percussion, and passionate vocals, this music will take you on a tropical journey! So strap in, because we’re going to the Caribbean!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "TWILIGHT JAZZ SERIES:  9th Season Launch Party!"
      }
    ],
