      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Join us as we team up with the Red Roof Retreat for the annual Jazz Big Band Fundraiser.  This year features 'Jim John's Swing Shift Big Band' and an opening set with the Juliet Dunn Trio.    A great evening of Swing Era Jazz with dancing, auctions, nibbles, wine  + fun.    Friday, November 4th, 2016 at the NOTL Community Centre (14 Anderson Lane)    Doors open: 7pm    Music + Dancing: 7:30pm    TICKETS: $45    *** FREE PARKING ***    To buy online CLICK HERE (online tickets coming soon)            Number of Tickets (Tables)        One Ticket $45.00 CAD  Two Tickets $90.00 CAD  Three Tickets $135.00 CAD  Four Tickets $180.00 CAD  Five Tickets $225.00 CAD  Six Tickets $270.00 CAD  Seven Tickets $315.00 CAD  Eight Tickets $360.00 CAD  Table of Ten (10) $450.00 CAD  2 Tables of Ten (10) $900.00 CAD                  To buy over the phone:  905-468-3024 or e-mail:  gillhome@cogeco.ca    *** All proceeds go to support the efforts of the Red Roof Retreat and the Niagara Jazz Festival.  ***    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;"
      }
    ],
