        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "    Twilight Jazz Series - St. Catharines Edition  Featuring: Sydney Bergevin    Sydney Bergevin is a 17-year-old singer, song writer and actress from Ontario, Canada who is known for her original songs No More Waiting, I Want It All and Can You Find Me Tonight. Aside from writing music and performing live, Sydney also actively pursues dramatic and musical roles in theatre. Syndey is a two-time winner of the TD Niagara Jazz Festival's 'Jazz 4 the Ages' competition.    Go to www.twilightjazz.ca for more info."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Twilight Jazz Series - Winter Wonderland"
