    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "We are happy to announce our 2nd annual collaboration with Music Niagara!  This year we are presenting the Joe Trio.        With an air of comedy, the Joe Trio has been delighting audiences across the globe since 1989. This trio is not afraid to mix styles in unpredictable, humorous, and captivating ways. The Joe Trio presents a well-chosen mix of jazz and classical music which is a perfect fit for this co-production in the idyllic setting of the Niagara vineyard, Pondview Estates Winery.    Featuring:  The Joe Trio    Date:  Friday, July 26, 2019  Time:  7 pm - 9 pm  Venue:  Pondview Estates Winery  Address: 925 Line 2 Road, Niagara-on-the-Lake, ON  Website:  www.pondviewwinery.com  Price:  $45.20    Looking for accommodations? CLICK HERE    *All pricing is subject to HST and handling fees    [cs_gb id=14969]  ABOUT THE BAND:  Joe Trio is not your average piano trio. They don't want to be neatly categorized, but instead strive for diversity, versatility, and more than a little humour and unpredictability. Their repertoire consists of the classics – from Papa Haydn to Uncle Shostakovich, new works by contemporary composers, and their own arrangements of popular, jazz and rock tunes. And they're not afraid to mix together so many styles of music into a single piece it makes your head spin. More than virtuosi, the Trio's members are fantastic performers who engage the audience in a way few classical musicians can. Amply witty, charming, and tremendously musical, Joe Trio leaves audiences with a new appreciation for classical music.  Looking to Book a Hotel?  The TD Niagara Jazz Festival is providing you with hotels and Airbnbs at the lowest prices available online. Book your stay directly through the map below! For your convenience, our hotel partner, White Oaks Resort and Spa, is highlighted in green.    NOTE: If the hotel your looking for does not have vacancy for your selected dates, it will not show up on the map.           document.addEventListener(&quot;DOMContentLoaded&quot;, function(e) {      // 1. Edit widget size      var settings22 = {        width: '100%', // set the width in px or %        height: '460px' // set the height in px or %      };      // 2. Fill out your config here and the rest should work      var s22obj = {        aid: 'niagarajazzfestival', // your affiliate id for tracking        address: '925 Line 2 Rd, Niagara-on-the-Lake, ON' , // Lat/Lng or full street address. For latlng use the &quot;lat&quot;:,&quot;lng&quot;: keys instead        checkin: '2019-07-26', //        maincolor: 'FFFFFF', // your main brand color in hex (without the #)        fontcolor: '50B948', // The navbar's font color in hex (without the #)        featuredhcids: '1109445', // Comma seperated list of HotelsCombined IDs to stand out from other hotels          chpincolor: '50b948', // If you have custom hotels, in hex (without the #)        navimage: 'https://niagarajazzfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/NJF-2018-logo.png', // If set, provide an absolute full URL to change the main logo in the navbar (button on the far left) image        markerimage: 'https://niagarajazzfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/NJF-2018-logo.png', // If set, provide an absolute full URL to change the marker (main map pin) image         zoom: '12',         disableautohover: true      };      // Leave this part intact      var params22=''; for (var key in s22obj){if (params22){params22 +='&amp;';}params22 +=key + '=' + encodeURIComponent(s22obj[key]);}var div22=document.getElementById('stay22-script'); div22.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend', '');    });      &nbsp;    &nbsp;"
      }
    ],
