    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "DIXIELAND JAZZ LUNCH in the VINES    EVENT: DIXIELAND JAZZ LUNCH in the VINES  DATE: Sunday, July 28, 2019  TIME: 11:30 am - 2:30 pm  LOCATION: Ravine Vineyards  ADDRESS: 1366 York Rd, St. Davids, ON  TICKET PRICE: $89 + HST (Includes Meal)  LUNCH MENU:  Family style: Tomato salad, chicken breast with seasonal sides/garnish, and a seasonal dessert    Look at the stunning venue!        Looking for accommodations? CLICK HERE    Buy Tickets    FEATURING THE HAMILTON DIXIELAND ALL-STARS    Hamilton Dixieland All-Stars were founded 14 years ago. Frank Musico and Jim Howard are the only two original members of the band. We have been entertaining audiences from Toronto to Niagara Falls. We perform at private events and celebrations, festivals, summer concerts and special concerts at churches, and a wide variety of parks in the GTHA region We are the “Band For All Reasons” with “Music Played to Order”!    Band Members: Frank Musico (Trumpet), Don Hall (Clarinet),  Don Templeton (Trombone),  Chris Broder (Piano), Jim Howard (Bass), John Colin (Drums).      Looking to Book a Hotel?  The TD Niagara Jazz Festival is providing you with hotels and Airbnbs at the lowest prices available online. Book your stay directly through the map below! For your convenience, our hotel partner, White Oaks Resort and Spa, is highlighted in green.    NOTE: If the hotel your looking for does not have vacancy for your selected dates, it will not show up on the map.           document.addEventListener(&quot;DOMContentLoaded&quot;, function(e) {      // 1. Edit widget size      var settings22 = {        width: '100%', // set the width in px or %        height: '460px' // set the height in px or %      };      // 2. Fill out your config here and the rest should work      var s22obj = {        aid: 'niagarajazzfestival', // your affiliate id for tracking        address: 'Ravine Vineyards, St Davids, ON' , // Lat/Lng or full street address. For latlng use the &quot;lat&quot;:,&quot;lng&quot;: keys instead        checkin: '2019-07-28', //        maincolor: 'FFFFFF', // your main brand color in hex (without the #)        fontcolor: '50B948', // The navbar's font color in hex (without the #)        featuredhcids: '1109445', // Comma seperated list of HotelsCombined IDs to stand out from other hotels          chpincolor: '50b948', // If you have custom hotels, in hex (without the #)        navimage: 'https://niagarajazzfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/NJF-2018-logo.png', // If set, provide an absolute full URL to change the main logo in the navbar (button on the far left) image        markerimage: 'https://niagarajazzfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/NJF-2018-logo.png', // If set, provide an absolute full URL to change the marker (main map pin) image         zoom: '13',         disableautohover: true      };      // Leave this part intact      var params22=''; for (var key in s22obj){if (params22){params22 +='&amp;';}params22 +=key + '=' + encodeURIComponent(s22obj[key]);}var div22=document.getElementById('stay22-script'); div22.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend', '');    });  "
      }
    ],
