      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "    Date:  Saturday, July 20, 2019  Time:  4 pm – 11 pm *Parade starts at 3 pm.  Venue:  Henley Grandstand  Address: 163 Main St, Port Dalhousie, St. Catharines, ON  Website: https://www.stcatharines.ca/en/playin/Beaches.asp  Price:  $15 for locals / $35 for Regular seating in VIP Zone / $149 for VIP Dinner (Chef Erik Peacock)  Other:  Impromptu Parade around Port at 3 pm    For the same price as the dinner, you can become a VIP WEEKEND PASS HOLDER - $149 + HST        There will also be Cajun and Creole food on the upper level from various food vendors (more details coming shortly)        *Full schedule coming soon!    Artists include:  Shuffle Demons, Heavyweights Brass Band, Turbo Street Funk, the Vaudevillian and more...    &nbsp;    &nbsp;                    &nbsp;    Join us as we celebrate the beautiful Niagara Region with this unique event with concerts taking place on a floating stage. This new fun-filled event will transform Port Dalhousie and Main Street (St. Catharines) into 'New Orleans of the North'!  Enjoy a parade, live music, Creole food, (food trucks and VIP Dinner*) and lots of fun activities!  Featuring the Shuffle Demons, Heavyweights Brass Band, Turbo Street Funk, The Vaudevillian and more...      Mask Making workshop (info coming soon...)    Cajun cooking demo and tasting with Chef Greg Willis of Kitchen Made (Limited space available) CLICK HERE to sign up **    *VIP dinner option with celebrity Niagara Chef Erik Peacock:  $149 + HST    Henry of Pelham Wines    Vieni Estates Sparking    Mill St Beer    Cocktail bar with New Orleans cocktails and our special house cocktail    A shuttle will be available  from Henley Island available (more info and shuttle schedule coming soon...)    Bicycle Valet on site (info coming soon...)  "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Niagara’s Summer MARDI GRAS"
      }
    ],
