        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Make your own mask and get ready for our Mardi Gras parade!    Join award-winning mask maker and puppeteer, Clelia Scala, and make your own masquerade mask for Niagara's Summer MARDI GRAS!  Wear it in the parade, at the event or mount it on your wall as a work of art!    DATE:  Saturday, July 13th, 2019  TIME:  9:30 am – 11:30 am  VENUE: The Kilt and Clover  ADDRESS: 17 Lock St., St. Catharines  PRICE: $39 + HST    CLICK HERE to register.    [cs_gb id=12111]      About Clelia  Clelia Scala is a mask and puppet designer, collage artist, and illustrator. She makes masks and puppets for theatre and teaches mask-making and puppet-making in classroom and workshop settings. Clelia recently won a St. Catharines Arts Award for Established Artist. We are thrilled to have her leading this workshop.    www.clelia.ca    &nbsp;"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "MASK MAKING WORKSHOP"
      }
