        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "JOIN US!  We are in the Grape and Wine Parade this year and we're doing it 'Mardi Gras style' with a '2nd Line! We'll be walking, dancing and marching behind the Magnolia Brass Band (10 piece Brass Band!)  Come out and join us!  You can even sit on our float and wave!     All are welcome and it is FREE to participate. Be sure to register below.  Saturday, September 28th, 11 am  (meet at 10:30 am)    Downtown St. Catharines            Parade photo courtesy MarkZelinski.com  Sign up to join us here:      https://forms.gle/TfWNjsWt8qHhtXep8          And a HUGE thanks to @Mike Odendahl from MOVINPICS for the great clip from our summer parade!     "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
