        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "DISCO DANCE PARTY!   March Mashtini Fundraiser  Friday, March 6, 2020  7:00 PM – 1:00 AM EST  White Oaks Conference Resort and Spa  253 Taylor Road  Niagara-on-the-Lake, ON L0S 1J0       DISCO and FUNK tunes with live music from HAUSQUAKE!  $39 Includes Live Music and Complimentary Mashtini Bar (see description below)    $29 Early Bird Pricing until Feb 20th, 2020    Buy Tickets  Join us as we combine our 11th annual 'Mashtini' party with our 2nd annual DISCO DANCE PARTY!     Enjoy a complimentary 'Mashtini Bar', live music, lots of socializing, a cash bar and dancing all night long. Disco and the 70's theme for this one so pull out those platforms and 'fros and come dressed up. GREAT prize for best costume!   There will also be a silent auction on site featuring great gifts and experiences from TD Niagara Jazz Festival partners.      A percentage of the proceeds will go to the Niagara Migrant Workers. The remainder of the proceeds will benefit the not-for-profit TD Niagara Jazz Festival in support of our 7th annual Festival in 2020.  Can’t join us this year? Your donation would be gratefully accepted. Thank you for helping us keep jazz alive in Niagara!                    CLICK HERE if you have a silent auction item to donate.       STAY SAFE!  If you would like to book a room for the night to avoid driving home after the party CLICK HERE.  Our partner White Oaks Resort and Spa has great rates for Friday, March 6th.  (Rates are not guaranteed and are subject to availability at the time of booking.)        What is a Mashtini you ask?  It started out as a 'holiday meal' in a glass 11 years ago at the Shea D Duo household (Peter Shea and Juliet Dunn) with mashed potatoes, turkey and all the fixin's in a martini glass.  Then the guests would enjoy martini's and dance the night away to live music.  11 years later the party has moved to March (too much going on over the holidays) and is now the annual fundraiser (and Disco Dance Party) for their TD Niagara Jazz Festival.    "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "DISCO DANCE PARTY! March Mashtini Fundraiser"
      }
