        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "DATE:            Tuesday, July 7, 2020  TIME:              6:00 pm – 7:00 pm EDT  VENUE:          Shady Acres Studio (St. Catharines) and New Orleans (This event will be Livestreamed)  PRICE:            FREE (Donations accepted)    * Please note that donations accepted to help the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!    Watch livestream on Facebook    Watch livestream on YouTube        [embed]https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ptyLDpmxQvM[/embed]  To donate and help support the festival:      &nbsp;        &nbsp;    WORKSHOP DESCRIPTION:    Join us on Tuesday evening, July 07, 2020 at 6:00 pm for another edition of Niagara's Summer MARDI GRAS Sessions.    We will continue the countdown to Niagara's Summer Mardi Gras with this interactive, live-streamed presentation by our special guest host, Witchdoctor Utu who will be sharing his knowledge and experience with New Orleans' cultural and voodoo history.    About Witchdoctor Utu    Witchdoctor Utu is an author, the founder of the Dragon Ritual Drummers, the Niagara Voodoo Shrine, and is a member of the New Orleans Voodoo Spiritual Temple. For the last eighteen years he has been immersed in the rootwork, conjure, and mysticism surrounding the lore and legacy of the Underground Railroad. Living in St. Catharines Ontario, where Harriet “Mama Moses” Tubman brought her “track” to its end, he has been upfront and integral over the last decade by continuing to uplift and elevate the spirit of Mama Moses and her surrounding spiritual court.  Utu has also been passionately teaching animal magic through lectures, rituals, and curio methods for ten years. He travels extensively in both Canada and the United States to teach, lecture, and facilitate rituals at some of the largest spiritual gatherings on the continent.    Learn more about Witchdoctor Utu online:  www.facebook.com/witchdoctor.utu"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
