      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "DATE:             Friday, August 14, 2020  TIME:              7:00 pm – 8:00 pm EDT  VENUE:          This event will be Livestreamed  PRICE:            FREE (Donations accepted)    * Please note that donations accepted to help the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!    Watch livestream on Facebook    Watch livestream on YouTube        [embed]https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LwPT8cdPxPY[/embed]  To donate and help support the festival:      &nbsp;  A huge thanks to the City of St. Catharines for their support!      &nbsp;        ABOUT THE SHOW:    Please join us online on Friday evening, August 14 at 7:00 pm EDT, when we’ll be livestreaming with host Juliet Dunn, our Executive Director and Artistic Producer, and her special guests to talk about our upcoming Jazz 4 the Ages Youth Competition and announce an exciting new series we have coming up: Hungry for Hammond. Tune in for news, interviews, and a sneak peek and upcoming programming!  Our Jazz 4 The Ages special guests include:      Thomas Steele Shakeela and her mom    Juvy Armineh and her mom    Lucine Isabella and her mom    Luz Emilio and his dad    Mario And Harry Bartlett    &nbsp;            ABOUT HUNGRY FOR HAMMOND:  A two-part dinner &amp; show series featuring four of Canada's finest Hammond organ artists.    Presented LIVE on two dates: Saturday, September 12 and Saturday, October 03.    Artist announcements, menu, further information and tickets on sale... SOON.  Find us online : www.NiagaraJazzFestival.com  Call us at: 1-844-LIV-JAZZ (1-844-548-5299)"
      }
    ],
