        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "DATE: Saturday, July 26, 2015  TIME: 11:00 am – 1:30 pm  VENUE: White Oaks Resort &amp; Spa, 253 Taylor Rd, Niagara-on-the-Lake, ON L0S 1J0  PRICE: $59 + HST    To donate and help support the festival:    Donations to the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) help us continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!          ABOUT THE SHOW  Come and spend a lovely summer afternoon under the tent at White Oaks Resort and Spa with Dinny and the Allstars. Dinny and the Allstars is an &quot;Allstar&quot; Dixieland ensemble, playing the music described by Louis Armstrong as &quot;jazz music&quot;, from New Orleans, to Memphis, to Chicago, to New York. Rags, stomps, marches, swing, blues, standards, - the music you listen to, through your feet!    Dinny and the Allstars have been performing since 2012 always engaging the audience in a happy time. The Allstars are booked regularly for the KW Dixieland Jazzclub, and the Simcoe County Jazz Society, and have performed for the London Jazz Society. Festivals include the Grand Internation Ragtime - Jasstime Foundation at Alexandria Bay, NY; the Elmira, NY Twin Tiers Jazz Festival; Wasaga Beach Blues Festival; Port Credit Southside Shuffle.    For more information about Dinny and the Allstars, click here.    BRUNCH MENU  Bruch will include a complimentary Mimosa. Cheers!      Fresh Vegetable Crudités    Garden Salad with a Variety of Toppings    Choice of Greek, Spinach or Caesar Salad    Eggs Benedict    Scrambled Eggs    Home Fried Mini Red Potatoes    Bacon, Sausage and Ham    Pancakes    Fresh Fruit Cocktail    Chicken Breast with Wild Mushroom Cream Sauce    Long Grain and Wild Rice    Fresh Seasonal Vegetables    Chef’s Dessert Table    Coffee, Tea and Soft Drinks    Complimentary Mimosa  "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Dixieland Jazz Brunch 2015"
      }
    ],
