    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "📅 DATE: Friday, April 30, 2021 - Sunday, June 6, 2021  🏟️ VENUE: ONLINE auction    SEE OUR AUCTION  The TD Niagara Jazz Festival is raising funds to help keep music alive in Niagara and beyond. The festival is in its 8th season and is looking for support during the COVID-19 pandemic. Proceeds from this auction will help the festival sustain various programming including the enhancement of artist fees as well as the production of its ‘Jazz 4 the Ages’ youth program.    You will find many items here that would be great for Mum on Mother’s Day or simply a treat for yourself.    Thank you in advance for your support!    Warm regards,    Juliet Dunn and Peter Shea  Festival Co-Creators            SUPPORT THE FESTIVAL  To donate and help support the festival:    Donations to the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) help us continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!          ABOUT THE FESTIVAL  The TD Niagara Jazz Festival is a year-round celebration of all types of jazz and world music, performed in intimate indoor and outdoor venues in the heart of Niagara’s stunning wine country.    The TD Niagara Jazz Festival presents the finest Canadian and internationally-acclaimed jazz and world music musicians by way of spectacular concerts, wine, craft beer, and culinary packages, and free performances throughout Niagara-on-the-Lake, St. Catharines and selected locations throughout Niagara.    Please consider bidding on these donated auction items to help support live music in Niagara and beyond.    Contact Tricia or Darlene for more information on sponsoring the event:  sponsorship@niagarajazzfestival.com / admin@niagarajazzfestival.com"
      }
    ],
