    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "NOTICE: DUE TO COVID-19 COMPLICATIONS, THE KHEA EMMANUEL TRIO HAS BEEN MOVED TO A FUTURE DATE. WE WILL INSTEAD BE BROADCASTING A FREE PERFORMANCE.  📅 DATE: Sunday, May 30, 2021  🕑 TIME: 7:00 pm – 8:00 pm  🏟️ VENUE: Livestreamed online  💵 PRICE: FREE    WATCH ON FACEBOOKWATCH ON YOUTUBE  To donate and help support the festival:    Donations to the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) help us continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!          ABOUT THE SHOW  Unfortunately with the Ontario-wide Stay At Home order still in place, we have made the decision to postpone the upcoming Twilight Jazz Series Natalie Cole Tribute show, featuring the Khea Emmanuel Trio, scheduled for May 30th to a later date when our artists are able to perform together safely. Instead, we will be broadcasting a FREE livestreamed performance by the Shea D Duo, who live together and can perform safely. That's our very own festival co-creators Peter Shea and Juliet Dunn. Shea and D! :) Be sure to join us on May 30th at 7 pm for this new pop-up show, which will be broadcasted on both our Facebook and YouTube pages."
      }
    ],
