    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "📅 DATE: Sunday, January 16, 2022  🕑 TIME: 2:00 pm – 3:00 pm  🏟️ VENUE: Livestreamed  🗺️ ADDRESS: ONLINE  💵 PRICE: FREE or Pay What You Can  🗺️ CULINARY: Cheese and Charcuterie Box: $15 + HST; To Go Cocktails: $25 per Bottle (Pick up only) - Scroll down for Menu  GET TICKETSBUY FOODBUY DRINKS      To donate and help support the festival:    Donations to the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) help us continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!          ABOUT THE ARTISTS  The Shea D Duo (Peter Shea and Juliet Dunn) are the TD Niagara Jazz Festivals' co-creators.  This dynamic duo has been performing together for over 15 years and their sound is a cocktail of jazz, blues, pop and soul enhanced by piano and percussive instruments.    They have performed in Canada and across the globe.  (Morocco, Brazil, the Caribbean, and Hong Kong to name a few...    The duo calls Niagara home and you can find them performing all over the Niagara Region and beyond with their respective bands:  You can also find the duo performing with their other separate bands:  Le Trio Parisien, The Peter Shea Trio, The Juliet Dunn Quintet, and the Kitt Cat Collective.    Peter Shea graduated from the University of Toronto with a degree in jazz performance and composition and has been performing as a drummer, pianist and vocalist for over 20 years. He has played many prestigious jazz festivals, Montreal, Toronto etc., as well as playing for musical theatre productions such as The Jersey Boys, Tony and Tina’s Wedding and more.  Peter is the Artistic Consultant for the TD Niagara Jazz Festival.    Juliet Dunn is both an actress and singer and came to the Niagara Peninsula to perform and sing at the Shaw Festival Theatre. Her background ranges from popular music to jazz and she obtained most of her vocal training in Paris, France where she resided for 13 years.  For the past 8 years Juliet has been the Executive Director and Artistic Producer of the TD Niagara Jazz Festival.    The duo founded the Twilight Jazz Series in 2011 and from there started the TD Niagara Jazz Festival in 2014.  The duo has provided a platform and employment for thousands of musicians over the past decade and their Series and Festival has brought millions of dollars into the Niagara community.  (Hotels, restaurants, wineries, breweries, distilleries, theatres, and boutiques!  The duo is all about the community and their love for music and Niagara shines through in every performance!    Peter and Juliet also donate their time regularly to various local organizations and charities such as Hospice Niagara, Heart Niagara and Big Brothers and Sisters to name a few. They are more than happy to give back to such a wonderful community.  More info: www.julietdunn.ca / www.petersheamusic.com  The show is FREE or Pay What You Can    GET TICKETS        ABOUT THE SHOW  We're in lockdown again but we're not going to let that stop the music!    The TD Niagara Jazz Festival is pleased to be bringing you 2 livestreamed performances featuring the festival co-creators Juliet Dunn and Peter Shea.    This Sundays show is a 'BY REQUEST' show where the duo will be playing your favourite tunes! Sit back, relax and enjoy the show from the comfort of your own home!  Be sure to send your requests in to either admin@niagarajazzfestival.com or post on our social media channels!  GRAB SOME TAKE OUT!  And why not support our local businesses too? Pick up a Cheese and Charcuterie Box or a &quot;To Go&quot; Cocktail at our partner restaurants?  (order below)      Niagara-on-the-Lake: Spirit in Niagara Distillery  (Must be ordered by Fri, Jan 14 by 6:00 PM; Pickup anytime Sat, Jan 15 after 3 pm or  Sun, Jan 16 beteween 11 am - 5 pm)    St. Catharines (Port Dalhousie): Chz Plz  (Must be ordered by Fri, Jan 14 by 3:00 PM; Pickup anytime Sat, Jan 15 before 4:00 PM)          Cheese and Charcuterie Box  To Go Cocktails          Contains:  Your Choice of:      SPIRIT BOX      2 Canadian cheeses    4 local meats    2 Housemade dips    Housemade crostini    Olives    Dried Figs    CHZ PLZ BOX      2 artisan cheeses    2 artisan meats    House-made pickles    Preserves &amp; jams    Fresh and dried fruit    Fresh Bread            Sin Peach Tea (Juicy Peach with Fresh Brewed Sweet Tea)    Foxy Lemonade (Juiced up Vodka, Lavender Jasmine Syrup, Lemon)    Blue Plum Sour (Luscious Blue Plum, Cranberry Rosemary Syrup, Lime)    Pear Collins (Sweet Pear, Ginger Wildflower Syrup, Lemon)    Gin Gimlet (Juiced Up Gin, Simple Syrup, Lime)          Price: $15 + HST  BUY NOW  Price (per bottle): $25  BUY NOW        &nbsp;"
      }
    ],
