    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "📅 DATE: Thursday, July 21, 2022  🕑 TIME: 7:30 pm – 10:30 pm  🏟️ VENUE: The Hare Wine Co.  🗺️ ADDRESS: 769 Niagara Stone Rd, Niagara-on-the-Lake, ON L0S 1J0  💵 PRICE: Show Only: $59 + HST; Dinner &amp; Show: $109; Musicians/Arts Workers/Students SAVE 40% with Promo Code: THEMAWS2022  - Buy Now!   FOOD:  Add a Cheese and Charcuterie box for $19 + HST / Other food options available on site  BUY TICKETSBUY CHEESE &amp; CHACUTERIEARTISTSHEALTH AND SAFETY2022 SUMMER FESTIVAL  &nbsp;  Hosted by The Hare Wine Co.      &nbsp;        ABOUT THE SHOW  The evening's performance will feature Natural Elements with Jillian Mendez.    Tickets: Physical / digital tickets are not issued for this show. Admission is tracked through the order placed, and will be added to the event's guest list. Please retain your Order Confirmation email in case proof of purchase is required.    Cheese and Charcuterie and some Soul Food snacks are available on site.     Tickets are non-refundable. Artists and venues are subject to change. Please visit our Health and Safety page for updates on our current guidelines.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com.        ABOUT THE ARTISTS:  Natural Elements with Jillian Mendez features Jillian Mendez on lead vocals, Bryan Humphreys on drums and vocals, Roger Williams on bass guitar, Tony Barrett on guitar, John Pagnotta on saxophone and vocals, and Dylan Bell on keyboards and vocals.    Audiences are always amazed at the singing abilities of Jillian Mendez; she's dynamic and soulful. So too is the performance quality of the band, with their vocal harmonies and infectious grooves. The Natural Women Show celebrates the classic Soul songs of Aretha Franklin, Gladys Knight and Chaka Khan.    Jillian is a Juno-nominated recording artist who has recorded for Island Records.  Bryan has performed and/or recorded with Jeff Healey (Jeff Healey Band) and Curtis Lee (Jimmy McGriff and The Fifth Dimension).  Roger has worked extensively with Blues sensation Shakura S’Aida.  Dylan has worked with groups ranging from vocal jazz, Cadence, Hampton Avenue,  The Nylons, Autorickshaw, Lara St John and Honeymoon Suite.  Tony has performed and/or recorded with such artists as Rita Marley, Black Uhuru and Salome Bey.  John has worked with The Soul Foundation and Still Life.    Visit Natural Elements at their website: https://sites.google.com/view/natural-elements/home    &nbsp;      To donate and help support the festival:    Donations to the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) help us continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!"
      }
    ],
