    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "📅 DATE: Monday, August 1, 2022  🕑 TIME: 7:30 pm – 10:30 pm  🏟️ VENUE: Spirit in Niagara Distillery  🗺️ ADDRESS: 458 Lakeshore Rd, Niagara-on-the-Lake, ON  💵 PRICE: $19 + HST; Musicians/Arts Workers/Students SAVE 25% with Promo Code: SOSMAWS2022 - Buy Now!       BUY TICKETSBUY SERIES PASSARTISTSABOUT THE SERIESHEALTH AND SAFETYVISIT SPIRIT IN NIAGARA  &nbsp;        ABOUT THE SHOW  The evening's performance will feature Gypsy Spirit... Two Djangos.    Guitar masters George Tirpko and Will Wilson capture the Fire and Romance  of &quot;Django and The Hot Club of France.&quot; Sometimes sweet and sometimes with gusto they achieve a blend of jazz and Gypsy passion with two guitars that swing with wild abandon! A style that is rarely matched.    Tickets: Physical / digital tickets are not issued for this show. Admission is tracked through the order placed, and will be added to the event's guest list. Please retain your Order Confirmation email in case proof of purchase is required.    Tickets are non-refundable. Artists and venues are subject to change. Please visit our Health and Safety page for updates on our current guidelines.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com.        ABOUT THE ARTISTS:  GEORGE TIRPKO      Ten thousand hours of rehearsal. A few thousand gigs. Lifelong resident of Niagara. Jazz, Blues, Country, Pop and Gypsy Jazz. Still in love with the guitar. Solo, duos and ensemble work. The goal is to stay fresh and vital!    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;  WILL WILSON    Will has played in countless dixieland and swing groups, and was guest banjo soloist for the Niagara Symphony’s 1998 centennial salute to George Gershwin. He has also previously performed with the TD Niagara Jazz Festival with the group Dr. Jazz and the Jazzbugs.      &nbsp;    Hosted by Spirit in Niagara Distillery            To donate and help support the festival:    Donations to the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) help us continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!"
      }
    ],
