    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "📅 DATE: Monday, September 5, 2022  🕑 TIME: 7:30 pm – 10:30 pm  🏟️ VENUE: Spirit in Niagara Distillery  🗺️ ADDRESS: 458 Lakeshore Rd, Niagara-on-the-Lake, ON  💵 PRICE: $19 + HST; Musicians/Arts Workers/Students SAVE 25% with Promo Code: SOSMAWS2022 - Buy Now!   BUY TICKETSARTISTSABOUT THE SERIESHEALTH AND SAFETYVISIT SPIRIT IN NIAGARA  &nbsp;        ABOUT THE SHOW  The evening's performance will feature the Peter Schmoll Duo.    Tickets: Physical / digital tickets are not issued for this show. Admission is tracked through the order placed, and will be added to the event's guest list. Please retain your Order Confirmation email in case proof of purchase is required. Tickets are non-refundable. Artists and venues are subject to change.    Please visit our Health and Safety page for updates on our current guidelines.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com.    &nbsp;        ABOUT THE ARTISTS:  PETER SCHMOLL      Peter Schmoll is a Niagara Falls-born, Toronto-based multi-instrumentalist, composer, performer, and educator. As guitarist and bandleader, he has played in bars and theatres everywhere from Halifax to Victoria to New York and back. He has also recorded three original studio albums and been a supporting musician on several others. Some notable festival appearances include Canadian Music Week, SCENE Music Festival, NXNE, Indie Week, Pelee Island Unplugged, and Cicada Music Festival among many others. Peter continues to perform and record in the Toronto area. He studies jazz guitar at Humber College and teaches music lessons throughout Toronto and the GTA.    &nbsp;        HOSTED BY SPIRIT IN NIAGARA DISTILLERY                  To donate and help support the festival:    Donations to the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) help us continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!"
      }
    ],
