    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Meet Dave Young and learn about the bass, his career and jazz music in general.  And in the most idyllic setting of a Barrel Cellar at Megalomaniac Vineyards.  &quot;The bass is fundamental to any music group.  Without the bass there is no foundation or time.  The bass also can play melodies and improvise!  So the bass is the most versatile instrument in the normal jazz group.  Therefore long live the bass!!! &quot;  Dave Young    DATE:  Sunday, July 30th, 2017  EVENT: Bass is Beautiful  STAGE:   Barrel Cellar at Megalomaniac Winery  ADDRESS:  3930 Cherry Avenue, Vineland, ON  TIME:  2:30pm – 4pm  TICKET PRICE:  $10 + HST - Reserve now... Space is limited  Sign up HERE            Session        Beautiful Bass (Dave Young) $10.00 CAD  Drums (Terry Clarke) $10.00 CAD  Choir with Cinnamon $10.00 CAD  Choir with Sophia $10.00 CAD                  "
      }
    ],
