    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Give the Gift of Jazz this Holiday Season!        The TD Niagara Jazz Festival has 6 different gift options for perfect holiday gifts for the music lovers in your life!  See details below and please note that all Gift Denominations Expire June on 3rd, 2024.  BUY GIFT CARD  Gift Denominations:      $29 + HST + Fees: Twilight Jazz Series Events      St. Catharines - Mahtay Café &amp; Lounge + Niagara Artists Centre    single shows Feb 25, Mar 10, May 26            $39 + HST + Fees Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues Series Events      Niagara-on-the-Lake - The Hare Wine Co. + Niagara Falls - Table Rock House Restaurant    single shows in Jan 22, Feb 5, February 15, April 22, May 13, June 3            $169 + HST + Fees: Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues Series Pass - 7th Edition      Niagara-on-the-Lake - The Hare Wine Co. + Niagara Falls - Table Rock House Restaurant    3 shows: Jan 22, Feb 5, Feb 15 (includes 3-course dinner)            $99 + HST + Fees: Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues Series Pass - 7th Edition      Niagara-on-the-Lake - The Hare Wine Co.    3 shows: Jan 22, Feb 5, Feb 15 (concert only)            $109 + HST + Fees - Carlos Morgan - R&amp;B Jazz Songbook      Table Rock House Restaurant Niagara Falls with a view of The Falls    Includes 3-course Dinner (fees include 18% gratuity)    Thursday, February 15th            $99 + HST + Fees: Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues Series Pass - 8th Edition       Niagara-on-the-Lake - The Hare Wine Co.    3 shows: April 22, May 13, June 3        BUY GIFT CARD  Concert Dates and Performing Artists    Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues Series - 7th Edition  CLICK HERE  ---    Twilight Jazz Series - 13th Season    Sun February 25th - Niagara Artists Centre - Harrison Kennedy: Electric Blues    Sun March 10th - Niagara Artist Centre - artist to be announced    Sun May 26th - Mahtay Café &amp; Lounge - artist to be announced    ---    Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues Series - 8th Edition    Mon April 22nd - The Hare Wine Co. - Laura Fernandez Trio: Spring into Jazz    Mon May 13th - The Hare Wine Co. - artist to be announced    Mon June 3rd - The Hare Wine Co. - artist to be announced    &nbsp;  BUY GIFT CARD  ---                                                "
      }
