    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "📅 DATE: Friday June 21, 2024  🕑 TIME: 9:30 pm – 1:30 am   🏟️ VENUE: The Local  🗺️ ADDRESS: 5984 Main Street, Niagara Falls  💵 PRICE: FREE COMMUNITY EVENT  💵 Summer Festival Full Pass: $229 + HST + Fees                     In Partnership with                  ABOUT THE EVENT:  Join us after our weekend concerts for our FREE After-hours Music Jam Sessions! Music Jams and Jazz Jams are an essential part of any major jazz or music festival. Festivals unite players from all over the Globe, and once they’re in town they just wanna play! Our NJF house trio will lead each jam session and they will be eagerly awaiting musicians and singers to come and sit in!  First come, first serve. Come out and support our local jam session partner venues by grabbing a drink or some food and getting up to JAM!             Presented by  &nbsp;      Click here to donate and support the festival:    Donations to the Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) help us continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!          BUY SUMMER PASS  &nbsp;  Supported in part by:  "
      }
    ],
