      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "📅 DATE: Saturday June 22, 2024  🕑 TIME: 1:30 pm – 4:30 pm  🏟️ VENUE: Ferox by Fabian Reis  🗺️ ADDRESS: 1829 Concession Road 4, Niagara-on-the-Lake  💵 PRICE: FREE COMMUNITY EVENT  💵 Summer Festival Full Pass: $229 + HST + Fees  🪑 SEATING: Available on site  🍕SNACKS: Available on site  🍷 WINE: Available on site                ABOUT THE EVENT:      Catch a FREE Pop-up show with the Niagara Jazz Festival one Saturday, June 22. Visit us at one of our venue partners across the Niagara Region and enjoy live jazz with your outing.  Featuring some of Ontario's finest jazz talent. Enjoy some of Niagara's finest wine while you enjoy live music in the vineyard.        ABOUT THE ARTISTS:      James Bryan (guitar)    James Bryan McCollum (PKA James Bryan) is a  Juno and Latin Grammy-winning songwriter, guitarist, and producer whose mission is to inspire, uplift and connect through music. His career began in Juno-winning Canadian acts The Philosopher Kings and Prozzak before James’ passion for collaboration grew into a global songwriting and recording career with top artists including Drake, Nelly Furtado, Shawn Mendes, Luis Fonsi, Martin Garrix, Yuna, Lisa Marie Presley and many more. James has co-written and performed on hundreds of recordings, with artists from every continent, and performed on stages from Wembley Stadium to Madison Square Gardens and Massey Hall. He has lived in Toronto, London, and LA and is at home in any studio in the world.                In Partnership with            The FEROX Story  With dominating wine quality and exceptional vineyard practices,  Ferox will be an influential name that will fiercely lead  the Niagara wine industry to become recognizable  for superior quality wines on a national and international level.    ONE DARING BOTTLE AT A TIME           Presented by  &nbsp;      Click here to donate and support the festival:    Donations to the Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) help us continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!          BUY SUMMER PASS  &nbsp;  Supported in part by:  "
      }
    ],
