      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅DATE: Monday, January 13th, 2025  🕑TIME: 7:00 pm – 9:30 pm  🏟️VENUE: The Hare Wine Co.  🗺️ADDRESS: 769 Niagara Stone Rd, Niagara-on-the-Lake  💵PRICE: $43 + HST + Fees  💵DISCOUNT:  $23 + HST + Fees - MAWS Discount (Musicians/Arts Workers/Students)   💵 SERIES PASS: $109 + HST + Fees (Includes 3 shows - does not include food)  🍕 FOOD: Artisanal Pizzas, sliders and other options are available for purchase on site  🚗 PARKING: Free on site                BUY TICKETS      BUY PASSES                            Presented by the Niagara Jazz Festival in partnership with                      ABOUT THE SHOW      The Johnny Max Band will perform a mix of Blues, Soul, and rhythm &amp; Blues with a few covers thrown in...Be sure to come out for the Johnny Max Band experience. Blues, to shake off those January Blues!          Please note:  One of the NJF  JAZZ 4 the AGES youth performers will be the opening act for this performance.  Artist TBC      ______________________________________________________________________________________________    ABOUT THE JOHNNY MAX BAND  That infamous Johnny Max Band has been touring across Canada for over 25 years! They have enamored audiences from Coast to Coast, creating new friends and fans along the way at various festivals and theatres. The new JMB six-piece lineup had just started to excite audiences when the pandemic hit. The only thing to do was hunker down and start writing new material for an upcoming album. They also reworked some of their previous songs for an acoustic album too. Why not? With two new albums to be released in 2023, along with a killer band and one of the best frontmen in The Canadian Blues scene, The Johnny Max Band was itching to get back on the road and showcase this new material to their friends across the country.    MORE INFO:  www.johnnymaxband.com                      BUY TICKETS    BUY PASSES      ______________________________________________________________________________________________  FOOD OPTIONS  The Hare Wine Co. is offering delicious menu items to accompany your wine and jazz experience. A small cheese and charcuterie board, focaccia, as well as your choice of 12-inch artisanal pizzas. Order directly from your table server the night of the show!    "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "TWILIGHT JAZZ %26 BLUES SERIES: January Blues - Johnny Max Band"
      }
    ],
