      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅DATE: Friday, June 27th, 2025  🕑TIME: 7:00 pm – 9:30 pm  🏟️VENUE: Henry of Pelham Family Estate Winery  🗺️ADDRESS: 1469 Pelham Road, St. Catharines, ON  💵PRICE (REGULAR): $53 + HST + FEES  💵DISCOUNT (MAWS):  $33 + HST + FEES  (Musicians/Arts Workers/Students)   🥩 FOOD: Short Hills Kitchen on site for dining  🍷DRINKS: Cash bar on site  🚗 PARKING: Free on site             BUY TICKETS                    ABOUT THE SHOW      SOUL JAZZ in the VINEYARD is one of Niagara Jazz Festival’s favorite signature events. This event is an electrifying display of soul jazz music that pulsates through the air, captivating the audience with its irresistible rhythm and heartfelt melodies all set to the beautiful backdrop of the Henry of Pelham Winery’s vineyard.    For the 1st set, multi-instrumentalist Quincy Bullen and his band will energize the atmosphere with their infectious groove and soulful melodies. Then for the 2nd set they will be joined by the incredible vocalist Quisha Wint, who will blend Blues,  R&amp;B and Jazz with a performance full of emotional depth and vocal elegance.    JAZZ 4 the AGES Youth Performer     Rohaam Keyvani         ABOUT QUINCY BULLEN           Quincy Bullen is a multi-talented artist whose eclectic style and musical sensibility have won him a devoted following. With a background in classical and jazz music, Quincy has put his own twist on R&amp;B, jazz, and soul, reinvigorating modern music and contemporary jazz standards with his unique approach.    CLICK HERE for more information about Quincy.      &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    ABOUT QUISHA WINT     &nbsp;      Quisha Wint was born to sing and entertain. She grew up in a Jamaican/Canadian home listening to Reggae, Motown, Gospel, R&amp;B, then entered the jazz program at Humber College in the mid ’90s. From there she embarked upon her dream of performing with well-known musicians, which took her to exciting overseas hotel engagements. Since then, Quisha has sung in many parts of Asia, Europe, North America, and Caribbean.      CLICK HERE for more information about Quisha.      ABOUT THE BAND      Quisha Wint on Vocals    Quincy Bullen on Piano &amp; Guitar    TBC on Bass    TBC on Drums                Presented by                  In partnership with          Supported by          Sponsored by        &nbsp;                    PLEASE NOTE:      Outdoor environment, dress for comfort.    This event will take place ‘Rain or Shine’ (Event takes place under a tent)    Tickets are non-refundable.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com                        BUY TICKETS  "
      }
    ],
