    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "    [embed]https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X8LsBxJSYGY[/embed]  📅DATE: Sunday, June 29th, 2025  🕑TIME: 11:00 am – 9:00 pm  🏟️VENUE: Battle of Beaverdam park  🗺️ADDRESS: Sullivan Ave, Thorold, ON L2V 3K1  💵PRICE: FREE COMMUNITY EVENT - All ages welcome!  🪑SEATING: BYOC - Bring your own lawn chair!  🍕FOOD: Food Trucks + Beverage Vendors (including licensed)  🚗 PARKING: Free on site              ABOUT THE EVENT:     Niagara Jazz Festival presents Music in the Park. Music in the Park is a vibrant, family-friendly event that celebrates jazz and world music in the heart of the Niagara Region during the NJF summer festival. This year the vent kicks off a 3-day celebration in the City of Thorold.*  This event features multiple music stages, Tent Talks, artisan vendors, food trucks, beverages, and interactive activities for all ages. Highlights include live performances by diverse artists, free salsa dance lessons (Salsa, African, Bhangra) and a dedicated Kids Zone with games and creative activities.​ Register for this FREE event below.  * Day 2 - Blues on the Battlefield / Day 3 - Canada Day      Host Emcee:  Ori Dagan    Ori Dagan is a Canadian jazz vocalist and songwriter celebrated for his unique scat singing and inventive jazz interpretations. He is also a dynamic emcee, known for hosting jazz events and festivals with engaging wit, charm, and a deep understanding of the music. CLICK HERE for Ori's full bio.                  SIGN UP HERE          This is a FREE Event!  If you sign up, you will be entered for a chance to win 2 tickets to our Flagship event on Friday, June 20th!             [table id=51 /]                      Event Artists:    The Snake Charmer  &nbsp;      Angelique Francis - Lead Vocals,  Bass, Harmonica, acoustic guitar    &nbsp;        Sonia Aimy    &nbsp;        Johannes Linstead      &nbsp;              Anthony D'Alessandro &amp; Benny Benack III  &nbsp;        JAZZ 4 the AGES Youth Performers  Amanda Braam Trio            SIGN UP HERE              Presented by                In partnership with                  Supported by              Sponsored by                     &nbsp;      Official Transportation Sponsor                          SIGN UP HERE      Please note: This is an outdoor event and it will take place rain or shine."
      }
    ],
