      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅DATE: Saturday, June 21st, 2025  🕑TIME: 7 pm – 9:30 pm  🏟️VENUE: The Exchange Cultural Hub &amp; Market  🗺️ADDRESS: 5943 Sylvia Pl, Niagara Falls, ON L2G 1S9  💵PRICE (REGULAR): $33 + HST + FEES  💵DISCOUNT (MAWS):  $23 + HST + FEES  (Musicians/Arts Workers/Students)   🍕 FOOD: Snack foods available on site.   🍷DRINKS: Cash bar on site  🚗 PARKING: Free on site                 BUY TICKETS        BUY WEEKEND PASSES                  Celebrate The Shuffle Demons 40th Anniversary!                &nbsp;    [embed]https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GU6iHNpOvTE[/embed]                          ABOUT THE SHOW      Presented by the Niagara Jazz Festival, 🎷 Sax in the City at the Niagara Falls Exchange will be an unforgettable night of music, energy, and wild saxophone power with The Shuffle Demons!  This iconic Canadian band mixes jazz, funk, rap, and world grooves with outrageous costumes, high-octane stage antics, and serious musical chops. Known for parading through the crowd and delivering electrifying performances, The Shuffle Demons are a festival favorite around the world — and now they’re bringing the party to Niagara Falls!  It’s their 40th anniversary, and they’re throwing a party you’ll never forget!  Expect killer solos, infectious rhythms, and a full-on sonic spectacle from one of Canada’s most unique and entertaining bands. Whether you're a jazz lover or just in it for the good vibes, this is one show you don't want to miss!                    ABOUT THE SHUFFLE DEMONS    The Shuffle Demons are a high-energy Canadian band known for their virtuosic playing, outrageous costumes, and wild stage antics. Blending jazz, funk, rap, and world music, they burst onto the scene with a genre-bending sound inspired by Sun Ra, Mingus, Run DMC, and the Beastie Boys. A festival favorite around the world, they've released 10 albums, toured across six continents, and remain a crowd-pleasing act with unforgettable performances. The current lineup features Juno Award-winning musicians and delivers the same explosive mix of music, poetry, danceable grooves, and audience-parading fun that made them legendary.      CLICK HERE for more information about the Shuffle Demons          JAZZ 4 the AGES Youth Performers      Quibble Quartet is a sax quartet from the Woodlands Secondary School in Mississauga. Jason Gali, leading the quartet on soprano sax, began piano at 6 and the alto sax at 11. He is passionate about learning about musical composition and mastering jazz improvisation. CLICK HERE for more info.              BUY TICKETS      BUY WEEKEND PASSES                    Presented by            Venue Partner              Supported by          Sponsored by                                                        BUY TICKETS      BUY WEEKEND PASSES                              PLEASE NOTE:      Tickets are non-refundable.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com                        "
      }
    ],
