      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅DATE: Sunday, June 22nd, 2025  🕑TIME: 12 pm – 4 pm*  🏟️VENUE: St George Serbian Orthodox Church  🗺️ADDRESS: 6085 Montrose Rd, Niagara Falls, ON  💵PRICE (REGULAR - with Picnic): $65 + HST + FEES  💵DISCOUNT (MAWS - Show only):  $25 + HST + FEES  (Musicians/Arts Workers/Students)   🍕 FOOD: Snack foods available on site.   🍷DRINKS: Cash bar on site  🚗 PARKING: Free on site     *Doors and Picnic from noon / Music &amp; Dancing from 1 - 4 pm                BUY TICKETS        BUY WEEKEND PASSES                  Get ready to Swing!  Click the photo to watch them perform.                          ABOUT THE SHOW          🎶 Swingin’ Jazz Picnic with The Sonny Balcones 🎶  Join us for a toe-tappin’ afternoon of live jazz, dancing, delicious food, and fun for the whole family at the beautiful Serbian Orthodox Church grounds in Niagara Falls! Featuring the smooth and sassy sounds of The Sonny Balcones, this picnic promises good vibes, great music, and a whole lot of swing.  Free dance lesson provided by Lindy Hop Niagara!  Bring your friends, your family,  your dancing shoes, and your appetite — all ages welcome for this feel-good community celebration!                       ABOUT THE ARTISTS        ABOUT THE SONNY BALCONES    The Sonny Balcones are a Toronto based jazz band that combine 30's,40's and 50's swing with french jazz and sultry torch songs. Its members all hail from Toronto and have been part of its lively jazz music community for many years, performing together for the last 8. Their vintage vibe and swing sound fill dance floors at clubs and swing events throughout the city. With a sound that ranges from silly to soulful and sultry they pull in elements of swing era classics, old New Orleans jazz, soul and torch songs.  Outdoor events have been a great success for the band. People are drawn in by the energy. Crowds have been thrilled to hang out in the park on a summer night, watch the dancers and enjoy some rare and familiar tunes. They want you dancing and having fun, or falling in love, or both!  They have a vintage feel that is both quirky and romantic with their live shows having a comfort and familiarity as if an old friend has invited you into their living room while they tell you about all their (mis)adventures since you last met.    CLICK HERE for more information about the Sonny Balcones        JAZZ 4 the AGES Youth Performers  Info coming soon...                  ABOUT THE PICNIC LUNCHES      Prepared by The Pie Guys Bakery&amp; Café    &nbsp;  Sandwich Boxes (Choice of Ham &amp; Swiss / Chicken Salad / Veggie Wrap) with Strawberries, Grapes, 2 X Cheese &amp; Cookie        Charcuterie Box ( 5 pieces of Cured Meats /5 pieces of mixed Cheese / Crackers / Strawberries / Grapes / Mixed Nuts  PLEASE PLACE YOUR ORDER HERE  &nbsp;          &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;                                            &nbsp;                      &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;      Presented by                        Supported by              Sponsored by                                       &nbsp;                                    BUY TICKETS      BUY WEEKEND PASSES                              PLEASE NOTE:      Tickets are non-refundable.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com                        "
      }
    ],
