      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅DATE: Monday, November 3rd, 2025  🕑TIME: 7 pm – 9:30 pm  🏟️VENUE: The Hare Wine Co.  🗺️ADDRESS: 789 Niagara Stone Road, Niagara-on-the-Lake, ON  💵PRICE (REGULAR): $39 + HST + FEES  💵DISCOUNT (MAWSU):  $19 + HST + FEES  (Musicians/Arts Workers/Students/Under 30)   💵PASSES for FULL SERIES: (3 events - Oct 6, Nov 3, Dec 1):   $39 + HST + FEES  🍕 FOOD: Snack foods available on site.   🍷DRINKS: Cash bar on site  🚗 PARKING: Free on site     *Doors at 6 pm / Concert starts at 7 pm                 BUY TICKETS        BUY SERIES PASSES                ABOUT THE SHOW        🎶 Redefining the Jazz Duo 🎶  Whether you're a longtime jazz enthusiast or simply seeking a soulful, thought-provoking live experience, ESMO offers a performance that is emotionally resonant, musically rich, and truly unforgettable.                  ABOUT THE ARTISTS  ESMO - Elizabeth Shephard + Michael Occhipinti        ESMO is a Canadian jazz duo comprised of Elizabeth Shepherd and Michael Occhipinti. Together, they bring together Shepherd’s vocal richness and emotive delivery with Occhipinti’s genre-blending arrangements and instrumental artistry — merging jazz, soul, and improvisational flair. ESMO offers a sophisticated, intimate sound, balancing composition and spontaneity with deep emotional resonance.            &quot;ESMO: Redefining Jazz, One Note at a Time&quot;”  CLICK HERE for more information about ESMO                BUY TICKETS        BUY SERIES PASSES                                                    WATCH HERE        [embed]https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Wzw1_EbvpHU&amp;list=RDWzw1_EbvpHU&amp;start_radio=1[/embed]                                BUY TICKETS            BUY SERIES PASSES                          Presented by          Juliet Amanda Dunn Entertainment                     In partnership with          Sponsored by                  BUY TICKETS      BUY SERIES PASSES                                                                  PLEASE NOTE:                Tickets are non-refundable.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com                        "
      }
    ],
