    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅DATE: Monday, October 6th, 2025  🕑TIME: 7 pm – 9:30 pm  📍VENUE: The Hare Wine Co.   🗺️ADDRESS: 789 Niagara Stone Road, Niagara-on-the-Lake, ON   💵PRICE (REGULAR): $39 + HST + FEES  💵DISCOUNT (MAWSU):  $19 + HST + FEES  (Musicians/Arts Workers/Students/Under 30)   💵PASSES for FULL SERIES: (3 events - Oct 6, Nov 3, Dec 1):   $39 + HST + FEES  🍕FOOD: Snack foods available on site.   🍷DRINKS: Cash bar on site  🚗 PARKING: Free on site   *Doors at 6 pm / Concert starts at 7 pm                 BUY TICKETS        BUY SERIES PASSES                ABOUT THE SHOW        🎶 Musical Journeys 🎶  Join keyboardist and vocalist Nick Mustapha for a powerful night where jazz meets soul. Blending original music with fresh takes on classic covers, Nick delivers smooth vocals, rich grooves, and genre-defying energy that’s not to be missed. Nick will be joined by Paul Callander on trumpet and Max Valihora on drums.                  ABOUT THE ARTIST  Nick Mustapha blends the rich textures of jazz, R&amp;B, and hip-hop into a sound that’s both fresh and unforgettable. Known for his high-energy arrangements and smooth vocals, Nick brings an electrifying presence to every performance. Over the past decade, Nick has honed his craft on stages across Canada, the United States, and Europe, supporting a wide range of acclaimed artists. His dedication and versatility earn him the title of 2023 Jazz for the Ages Competition Winner, collaborating with some of the industry’s finest, including Laila Biali, Larnell Lewis, Jeremy Ledbetter, and Eliana Cuevas, continually pushing the boundaries of genre and sound.          “Unforgettable Sound. Unmatched Energy. Nick Mustapha.”  CLICK HERE for more information about Nick Mustapha                BUY TICKETS        BUY SERIES PASSES                                                      WATCH HERE        One of our favourite arrangements that Nick does of Somewhere Over the Rainbow:  CLICK HERE to view                          BUY TICKETS            BUY SERIES PASSES                            Presented by              Juliet Amanda Dunn Entertainment                     In partnership with          Sponsored by                  BUY TICKETS      BUY SERIES PASSES                                                                  PLEASE NOTE:                Tickets are non-refundable.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com                        "
      }
