    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅DATE: Sunday, November 16th, 2025  🕑TIME: 7 pm – 9 pm  🏟️VENUE: SECRET VENUE* (TBA)  🗺️ADDRESS:  SECRET VENUE* (TBA)  💵PRICE (REGULAR): $33 + HST + FEES  💵DISCOUNT (MAWSU):  $19 + HST + FEES  (Musicians/Arts Workers/Students/Under 30)   💵PASSES for FULL SERIES: (3 events - Oct 19, Nov 16, Dec 21):   $79 + HST + FEES  🍕 FOOD: Snack foods available on site.   🍷DRINKS: Cash bar on site  🚗 PARKING: Free on site     * Secret Venue is announced when you purchase your ticket!  Doors at 6 pm / Concert starts at 7 pm                 BUY TICKETS        BUY SERIES PASSES                        ABOUT THE SHOW        🎶 Here's to Life 🎶  Join jazz vocalist John Neudorf and friends for an unforgettable night of music as he presents Here’s to Life, a live performance inspired by his latest recording. Blending heartfelt originals with fresh, creative takes on pop and jazz standards, this show promises to be both intimate and electrifying.    John will be joined by an outstanding trio featuring Nancy Walker on piano and Clark Johnston on bass — two of Canada’s finest jazz artists. Together, they’ll bring a rich, expressive sound to the stage, celebrating life, love, and the power of song.    Merch will be available at the show — including CDs, vinyl, and T-shirts — so you can take the music home with you.    &quot;Here’s to life. Here’s to music. Don’t miss it.&quot;                  ABOUT THE ARTIST   John Neudorf is a seasoned Canadian jazz vocalist, known for his warm phrasing, strong scat ability, and deep roots in both jazz and blues. A former jazz drummer trained at Mohawk College, he transitioned into singing under the guidance of Rosemary Burns. Over his 30‑year career, he’s performed with local jazz ensembles in the Niagara Region, fronted blues bands, and released albums like I Remember (2001) and Here’s to Life, which showcase standards and original material. John brings both passion and authenticity to every performance.            CLICK HERE for more information about John                      BUY TICKETS        BUY SERIES PASSES                                  Presented by    Juliet Amanda Dunn Entertainment                     In partnership with                        Part of the                BUY TICKETS      BUY SERIES PASSES                              PLEASE NOTE:      Tickets are non-refundable.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com                        "
      }
    ],
