      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅DATES: Sundays, October 19th, November 16th and December 21st, 2025  🕑TIME: 7 pm – 9 pm  🏟️VENUES: SECRET VENUES (TBA)  🗺️ADDRESS:  SECRET VENUES (TBA)  💵PRICE (REGULAR): $79 + HST + FEES (for all 3 shows! - Savings of $18)  🍕 FOOD: Snack foods available on site.   🍷DRINKS: Cash bar on site  🚗 PARKING: Free on site     *Doors at 6 pm / Concert starts at 7 pm                 SHOW INFO    (click on date to see full show info)  October 19th - Carolyn Credico + Ross Wooldridge:  Hidden Gems and Buried Treasures  November 16th - John Neudorf Trio:  Here's to Life  December 21st - Juliet Dunn Trio:  Mistletoe and Melodies  ***PLEASE NOTE:  Secret Venue will be revealed to you upon purchase of your ticket or pass. ***   Doors at pm / Concerts starts at 7 pm                 BUY SERIES PASSES                                                  &nbsp;                ABOUT THE SECRET SALON SERIES  ✨ Juliet Dunn’s Secret Salon Series ✨  Experience live music like never before. Curated by vocalist and producer and Niagara Jazz Festival co-creator and Executive and Artistic Director, Juliet Dunn, the Secret Salon Series brings intimate performances to unique, undisclosed venues across Niagara — revealed only days before the show.  Expect world-class musicians, cozy vibes, and unforgettable nights of jazz, soul, and discovery.  Limited tickets. Secret location. Pure magic!  🎶 Where music meets mystery.                          BUY SERIES PASSES                              Presented by    Juliet Amanda Dunn Entertainment                     In partnership with                                                                          BUY SERIES PASSES                          PLEASE NOTE:      Tickets are non-refundable.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com                        "
      }
