    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅DATE: Tuesday, December 2nd, 2025  🕑TIME: 12:00 am - 11:59 pm   🏟️VENUE: ONLINE                 DONTATE NOW                            Support the Niagara Jazz Festival  Keep the Music Alive. Keep the Community Thriving.  Giving Tuesday is a global day of generosity — a moment when people come together to support the causes that make a difference.This year, we invite you to stand with the Niagara Jazz Festival and help us continue bringing world-class music, cultural experiences, and community connection to the Niagara Region.          🎷 Why Your Support Matters  For over a decade, the Niagara Jazz Festival has been dedicated to:          Showcasing world-class jazz artists from around the globe        Supporting local musicians and emerging talent with our JAZZ 4 the AGES program        Providing free and accessible community concerts        Creating youth opportunities through volunteering, workshops, and mentorship        Bringing people together through the power of live music      Your donation ensures that our festival remains vibrant, inclusive, and accessible for years to come.          💛 What Your Donation Supports      $25 - Every contribution — big or small — makes a real impact    $50 - Supports our JAZZ 4 the AGES youth programming and music education initiatives    $100 - Helps towards fees for community performances and outreach.    $250+ - Directly supports artist bookings, staging, production, and the creation of free public events.    DONATE MONTHLY - Monthly donations help with all of the above.    Custom Gifts  Your generosity fuels everything we do — choose any amount that feels meaningful to you.          ❤️ Donate Now  Your contribution today will help us continue creating unforgettable musical moments.  👉 DONTATE NOW  Secure online donations. Tax receipts provided.  With your help, the music doesn’t stop. It grows.          🎁 This Giving Tuesday, Give the Gift of Music  Your support allows us to keep live jazz thriving in Niagara, engage audiences of all ages, and nurture the next generation of artists and music lovers.  With your help, the music doesn’t stop. It grows.          🌟 Other Ways to Support  Not able to give financially today? You can still make a difference!          Share this page with friends, family, and music lovers        Attend an upcoming performance        Volunteer with us        Become a festival ambassador by spreading the word      Every action helps amplify the rhythm of our community.          🎶 Thank You for Being Part of the Melody  The Niagara Jazz Festival exists because of people like you.Your generosity keeps live music vibrant, accessible, and alive in the Niagara Region.  Together, we keep the jazz spirit strong — today, and for generations to come.                            CLICK HERE TO DONATE                                                DONATE TODAY            "
      }
    ],
