    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅DATES: Sundays, February 15th, March 8th, and March 22nd, 2026  🕑TIME: 7 pm – 9 pm  🏟️VENUES: SECRET VENUES (TBA)  🗺️ADDRESS:  SECRET VENUES (TBA)  💵PRICE (REGULAR): $79 + HST + FEES (for all 3 shows! - Savings of $18)  🍕 FOOD: Snack foods available on site.   🍷DRINKS: Cash bar on site  🚗 PARKING: Free on site     *Doors at 6 pm / Concert starts at 7 pm                 SHOW INFO    (click on date to see full show info)  February 15th - Celebrating Black History Month:  Sammy Jackson Duo  March 8th - Celebrating International Women's Day: Genevieve (Gigi) Marentette  March 22nd - Shadows and Light: Whitney Ross-Barris Duo   ***PLEASE NOTE:  Secret Venue will be revealed to you upon purchase of your ticket or pass OR 9 days prior to the event. ***   Dinging from 5 pm / Doors at 6:30 pm / Concerts starts at 7 pm                 BUY SERIES PASSES                          ABOUT THE SECRET SALON SERIES  ✨ Juliet Dunn’s Secret Salon Series ✨  Experience live music like never before. Curated by vocalist and producer and Niagara Jazz Festival co-creator and Executive and Artistic Director, Juliet Dunn, the Secret Salon Series brings intimate performances to unique, undisclosed venues across Niagara — revealed only days before the show.  Expect world-class musicians, cozy vibes, and unforgettable nights of jazz, soul, and discovery.  Limited tickets. Secret location. Pure magic!  🎶 Where music meets mystery.                          BUY SERIES PASSES                              Presented by    Juliet Amanda Dunn Entertainment                     In partnership with                                                                          BUY SERIES PASSES                          PLEASE NOTE:      Tickets are non-refundable.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com                        "
      }
    ],
