    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅DATE: Monday, March 2nd, 2026  🕑TIME: 7 pm – 9:30 pm  🏟️VENUE: The Hare Wine Co.  🗺️ADDRESS: 789 Niagara Stone Road, Niagara-on-the-Lake, ON  💵PRICE (REGULAR): $39 + HST + FEES  💵DISCOUNT (Promo Code - MAWSU-2026): -50% (19.50) + HST + FEES   (Musicians/Arts Workers/Students/Under 30)  🍕 FOOD: Snack foods available on site.   🍷DRINKS: Wine by the glass available  🚗 PARKING: Free on site     *Doors at 6 pm / Concert starts at 7 pm                 BUY TICKETS          BUY a SERIES PASS      ABOUT THE SHOW          🎶 PAINTING WITH THE TRIO 🎶      Painting with the Trio showcases the Ewen Farncombe Trio as they blend creativity, interplay, and imagination into a richly textured performance. With deep respect for the legendary piano trios that shaped jazz history, the group paints their own musical canvas—honouring the past while boldly expressing their unique, contemporary voice.                rson award. While jazz is Ewen’s passion, he is a versatile player and is known to play many genres of music.                    &nbsp;                ABOUT THE ARTISTS      Ewen Farncombe is a Juno-nominated pianist and composer based out of Toronto and has been a professional on the scene there for nearly a decade. Having played on various recordings and with numerous bands, he has earned his reputation as a highly skilled musician. While he was attending Humber College for a degree in music performance, he received several prestigious awards, including the Hnatyshyn Foundation Oscar Peterson award. While jazz is Ewen’s passion, he is a versatile player and is known to play many genres of music.                                BUY TICKETS              BUY a SERIES PASS              Presented by    Juliet Amanda Dunn Entertainment                     In partnership with          Sponsored by:                    BUY TICKETS                BUY a SERIES PASS                  PLEASE NOTE:      Tickets are non-refundable.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com                        "
      }
    ],
