    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅 DATES &amp; TIMES:   - Thursday, June 25th:  7 pm - 10 pm - SOUL JAZZ in the VINEYARD @ The Hare Wine Co.   - Friday, June 26th:  7 pm - 10 pm - JAZZ in the VINEYARD @Reif Estate Winery  - Saturday, June 27th: 11 am - 9 pm - JAZZ POP-UP events / JAZZ CRAWL  - Saturday,  June 27th, 2026: 9:30 pm - 1 am - After Hours JAZZ JAM  - Sunday, June 28th, 2026:   11 am - 9 pm - JAZZ in the PARK  - Sunday, June 28th, 2026: 9:30 pm - 1 am - After Hours JAZZ JAM    🏟️ VENUES: Various (see above)  🗺️ ADDRESSES:  Various - Niagara-on-the-Lake  💵 PRICE (REGULAR): $99 + HST + FEES   (Early Bird Discount - $10 off)  🍕 FOOD: Snack and food options available on site at each event.   🍷DRINKS: Cash bar on site at each event.   🚗 PARKING: Details coming soon for each event.                   BUY an EARLY BIRD PASS                    ABOUT THE NIAGARA JAZZ FESTIVAL - SUMMER FESTIVAL  The Niagara Jazz Festival Summer Festival is a vibrant annual celebration held in Niagara-on-the-Lake’s wine country, bringing live jazz and world music to stunning outdoor (and select indoor) settings throughout the town.  The festival, now in its 13th Season, features winery concerts, intimate pop-up performances, and JAZZ in the PARK —a free, family-friendly event that invites the whole community to enjoy live music in a beautiful green space.  Blending exceptional artistry with Niagara’s renowned vineyards and relaxed summer atmosphere, the festival offers unforgettable musical experiences for all ages.  Early Bird Passes are now available!              BUY an EARLY BIRD PASS                                Presented by                                    PLEASE NOTE:      Tickets are non-refundable.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com                        "
      }
    ],
