    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅 DATES: Mondays, February 2nd  and March 2nd, 2026  🕑 TIME: 7 pm – 9:30 pm  🏟️ VENUE: The Hare Wine Co.    🗺️ ADDRESS:  769 Niagara Stone Road, Niagara-on-the-Lake  💵 PRICE (REGULAR): $66 + HST + FEES (for both shows! - Savings of $12)  🍕 FOOD: Snack foods available on site.   🍷 DRINKS: Cash bar on site  🚗  PARKING: Free on site     *Doors at 6 pm / Concert starts at 7 pm               SHOW INFO  (click on date to see full show info)  February 2nd - A Celebration of Black Musical Legacy - Khea Emmanuel Trio  March 2nd - Painting with the Trio: Ewen Farncombe Trio     Doors at 6 pm / Concerts starts at 7 pm                 BUY SERIES PASSES                      ABOUT THE TWILIGHT JAZZ &amp; BLUES SERIES  🎶 Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues Series 🎶  About the Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues Series  Now in it's 15th year, the Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues Series offers intimate, evening performances that celebrate the soul of jazz and blues in atmospheric venues across the region. Featuring outstanding local and international artists, the series blends timeless standards, contemporary sounds, and unforgettable collaborations.  The Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues invites audiences to experience world-class music up close in the warm glow of Niagara evenings at one of Niagara's premier wineries: The Hare Wine Co.  BUY SERIES PASSES                                  Presented by    Juliet Amanda Dunn Entertainment                     In partnership with                                                                          BUY SERIES PASSES                          PLEASE NOTE:      Tickets are non-refundable.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com                        "
      }
