        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "      GIVE THE GIFT OF JAZZ!    Give the gift of music this holiday season with the Niagara Jazz Festival.   Treat someone special to unforgettable live performances, soulful sounds, and memorable   experiences in beautiful Niagara settings. From intimate concerts to vibrant festival events,   a Niagara Jazz Festival ticket is a gift that goes beyond the holidays—creating moments,   memories, and music to cherish all year long. 🎶✨    See below for various passes which make great gifts over the holidays!                ✨ TWILIGHT JAZZ &amp; BLUES SERIES PASSES ✨    Now in it's 15th year, the Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues Series offers intimate, evening   performances that celebrate the soul of jazz and blues in atmospheric venues across the Niagara   Region. Featuring outstanding local and international artists, the series blends timeless   standards, contemporary sounds, and unforgettable collaborations. Set in cozy, scenic locations,   Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues Series invites audiences to experience world-class music up close in the   warm glow of Niagara evenings.    The series takes place the 1st Monday of every month from October - June at the Hare Wine Co.   in Niagara-on-the-Lake.    Price:  Passes are $99 + HST (individual shows are $39 + HST)    Early bird discount for $10 off:  Use promo code:  TJBS-EARLYBIRD-2026              BUY SERIES PASSES                                ✨ Juliet Dunn’s SECRET SALON SERIES PASSES ✨  Experience live music like never before. Curated by vocalist and producer and Niagara Jazz Festival co-creator and Executive and Artistic Director, Juliet Dunn, the Secret Salon Series brings intimate performances to unique, undisclosed venues* across Niagara — revealed only days before the show.  Expect world-class musicians, cozy vibes, and unforgettable nights of jazz, soul, and discovery.  Limited tickets. Secret location. Pure magic!  🎶 Where music meets mystery 🎶  Price:  Passes are $79 + HST (individual shows are $33 + HST)  Early bird discount for $10 off: Use promo code: SSS-EARLYBIRD-2026    * Some of the previous venues include:  Ravine Estates Winery, Lakeview Wine Co., NOTL Historical Museum, Niagara Artists Centre, Silversmith Brewing Co, Shady Acres Studio and many more...                     BUY SERIES PASSES                              ✨ SUMMER FESTIVAL PASSES ✨  The Niagara Jazz Festival Summer Festival is a vibrant annual celebration held in Niagara-on-the-Lake’s wine country, bringing live jazz and world to stunning outdoor (and select indoor) settings throughout the town.    The festival, now in its 13th Season,  features winery concerts, intimate pop-up performances, and JAZZ in the PARK at Simcoe Park—a free, family-friendly event that invites the whole community to enjoy live music in a beautiful green space.    Blending exceptional artistry with Niagara’s renowned vineyards and relaxed summer atmosphere, the festival offers unforgettable musical experiences for all ages.                &nbsp;                    BUY SUMMER FESTIVAL PASSES                            Presented by                        In Partnership with                                                                              PLEASE NOTE:      Tickets are non-refundable.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com                        "
      }
    ],
