    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅DATE: Sunday, February 15, 2026  🕑TIME: 7 pm – 9 pm  🏟️VENUE: SECRET Pop-Up Location*  🗺️ADDRESS: TBA (Upon Ticket purchase)  💵PRICE (REGULAR): $33 + HST + FEES  💵DISCOUNT (Promo Code - MAWSU2026):  - 50% ($16.50) + HST + FEES  (Musicians/Arts Workers/Students/Under 30)  💵SERIES PASS PRICE (3 Shows: Jan 25 / Feb 15 / Mar 8): $79 + HST + FEES  🍕 FOOD: Food available on site.   🍷DRINKS: Wine, beer, cocktails &amp; non-alcoholic options   🚗 PARKING: Free parking on site    *Doors at 6 pm / Concert starts at 7 pm                ABOUT JULIET DUNN'S SECRET SALON SERIES         Experience live music like never before. Curated by vocalist and producer and Niagara Jazz Festival co-creator and Executive and Artistic Director, Juliet Dunn, the Secret Salon Series brings intimate performances to unique, undisclosed venues across Niagara — revealed only days before the show.  Expect world-class musicians, cozy vibes, and unforgettable nights of jazz, soul, and discovery.  Limited tickets. Secret location. Pure magic!   Where music meets mystery.                BUY TICKETS    BUY a SERIES PASS            ABOUT THE SHOW          🎶 CELEBRATING BLACK HISTORY MONTH 🎶      An intimate evening of voice and guitar. Show description coming soon.                    ABOUT THE ARTISTS    Sammy Jackson is a Canadian jazz singer and songwriter based in Ontario, known for blending jazz with R&amp;B and pop influences. Born and raised in Toronto and St. Catharines, she studied vocal performance (including jazz voice) at the University of Toronto, where she also earned degrees in music and arts.    She first released an EP called Take Me Back in 2016, and her 2020 EP With You won the Juno Award for Vocal Jazz Album of the Year at the 2021 Juno Awards, one of Canada’s top music honors.  Sammy’s music is appreciated for its emotional depth and stylistic fusion, and she’s performed at major Canadian jazz festivals and venues, including the TD Toronto Jazz Festival and the Festival International de Jazz de Montréal.  She continues to release new work and build her profile as a compelling voice in contemporary Canadian jazz.  Tom Fleming is a Toronto-based Canadian jazz guitarist and composer, known for his modern, versatile playing and work with leading Canadian jazz artists, including vocalist Barbra Lica.  &nbsp;                                BUY TICKETS    BUY a SERIES PASS                              Presented by    Juliet Amanda Dunn Entertainment                     In partnership with          In partnership with:  SECRET VENUE! TBC                        BUY TICKETS    BUY a SERIES PASS                                PLEASE NOTE:      Tickets are non-refundable.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com                        "
      }
    ],
