      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "EXCLUSIVE VIP EVENT!    Sunday, December 15th, 2019        2:30 pm - 5:00 pm  Home for the Holidays   with the Shea D Duo and special guest Pat LaBarbera        Exclusive VIP  Event with only 35 seats available at a secret pop-up location in the Niagara area. (St. Catharines)   * Location revealed upon purchase of a ticket.    $79 + HST  Ticket price includes 1 complimentary beer or glass of wine and a delicious selection of hors d'oeuvres.        CLICK HERE    to buy tickets          Pat LaBarbera is jazz royalty and we are honored to have him for this intimate concert!   Pat has played with the likes of Ella Fitzgerald, Buddy Rich, Elvin Jones, Frank Sinatra, Tony Bennett, Count Basie, McCoy Tyner, Chick Corea, Woody Herman, Carlos Santana, The Temptations, The Supremes, and many more...  Pat will be joined by an All-Star rhythm section for this event:  Peter Shea  on Piano  Steve Lucas  on Bass  Adam Fielding on Drums  Juliet Dunn on Vocals (Shea D Duo band)  Click on musicians' names to link to their Artist Profiles.      PLEASE NOTE:  We will be FACEBOOK LIVE STREAMING this event on our FB page (www.facebook.com/jazzniagara) so you can tune in from your own home!  And you can donate HERE before during or after the fundraiser.  (As a charitable organization, we offer tax receipts!)      A portion of the proceeds from this event will go to The Unison Benevolent Fund    The Unison Benevolent Fund is a non-profit, registered charity that provides counseling and emergency relief services to  the Canadian music community.  They are there to help professional music-makers in times of hardship, illness or economic difficulties.      A huge thanks to our Exclusive Event Sponsor:        A huge thanks to our Valet Parking Sponsor:        Sponsorship Opportunities are still available starting at $250 and all levels include 1 - 2 tickets to the show!    CLICK HERE for sponsorship information."
      }
    ],
