    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "DATE:             Sunday, February 9 and Sunday, Feburary 23, 2020  TIME:              1:00 pm – 4:00 pm  VENUE:          Club 55  ADDRESS:    3 Niagara Stone Road, Niagara-on-the-Lake  TICKETS:       FREE Entry (must consume a drink or meal)    Tasty Menu - www.clubfiftyfive.com/menu  Live Karaoke!    Come out and sing your favorite tune (lyric sheets on-site) or join us for the 'Sing-a-long' tunes.    Featuring the TD NJF House Band:  Peter Shea on piano, Steve Lucas on bass, Dave Norris on drums.  Emcee/Host:  Juliet Dunn.  FREE!  (Must consume food or beverage to attend...)        Numerous studies have proven several key facts for those attending music and arts festivals:    - Improved mood    -Lowers stress levels    - Positive impact on the psychological and social well-being of young adults    - Provides the opportunity for people to think, feel and behave differently    - Encourages self-reflection and re-evaluation    - Feelings of positivity towards one's self and others and life in general    Very few things in life have the power to peacefully unite us all.  Let us come together to celebrate!    #livelovejazz  #lovelivekaraoke  #jazzniagara  #TDNiagaraJazzFestival  #TDMusic  #Club55    "
      }
    ],
