      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "DATE:             Monday, February 10, 2020  TIME:              7:00 pm – 9:30 pm  VENUE:          Secret Pop-up Location (St. Catharines)                          Intimate, 35-seat private venue  ADDRESS:     Revealed upon purchase of your ticket(s)  TICKETS:       $39.00 Single Show                         $119.00 Series Pass (all 4 shows)    *All tickets are subject to 13% HST and handling fees    &nbsp;        &nbsp;      ABOUT NATHAN:  Nathan Hiltz is a jazz guitarist based in Toronto, Canada. He was born in Nova Scotia then moved to Toronto in 1999. Since then he has recorded with such artists as Bernie Senensky, Jill Barber, Del Dako, Brand Disterheft, and Ori Dagan to name a few and even one tune with jazz icon Sheila Jordan!  Nathan performs over 200 gigs a year in Toronto and has toured extensively across Canada with Johnny Griffith, Terra Hazelton, and Melissa Lauren.  He attended Humber College (B.Mus) and later the University of Toronto (M.Mus) and has studied privately with Jim Hall, Reg Schwager, Adam Rodgers and many others. Nathan currently teaches at The Humber College of Creative and Performing Arts.        SCHEDULE:  6:00 pm    Doors  7:00 pm    Opening Act:  Dexter Sonier  7:20 pm    Feature Act, First Set  8:10 pm    Break  8:30 pm    Feature Act, Second Set  9:30 pm    End of Show      ABOUT DEXTER:  Dexter Frank is a musician and actor from St. Catharines currently completing his Bachelor of music at Humber College. His love and passion for song writing has brought him through many of the ups and downs of his life and has become the keen focus of his career. Dexter welcomes every opportunity he meets with love and excitement and will continue working hard to spread joy and make his audience happy.      ABOUT THE &quot;IN YOUR OWN BACKYARD&quot; GUITAR SERIES:  The TD Niagara Jazz Festival is pleased to present this 4-part series featuring four of Canada’s finest jazz guitar artists.  The series will be presented in a 35-seat intimate setting at a private studio located in the North end of St. Catharines (close to Niagara-on-the-Lake).  For privacy reasons, the secret location is only revealed upon purchase of tickets or passes. Please note that the location is fully accessible. There will be a cash bar on-site and complimentary light fare will be served.  Doors open at 6:00 pm. All shows are from 7:00 pm to 9:30 pm and include an opening act and a refreshment break.          THE FULL SERIES INCLUDES:  PART ONE: Monday, February 10, 2020  Nathan Hiltz Trio with Pat Collins and Morgan Childs  PART TWO: Monday, February 24, 2020 Ted Quinlan Duo with Mike Downes  PART THREE: Monday, March 9, 2020 RegSchwager Duo with Duncan Hopkins  PART FOUR: Monday, March 30, 2020 James Bryan Solo  *For single tickets click on artists' names.*"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Nathan Hiltz Trio (IN YOUR OWN BACKYARD 2020 Guitar Series, Part One)"
      }
