    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "📅 DATE: Sunday, July 30, 2017  🕑 TIME: 4:30 PM - 6:30 PM &amp; 7:00 PM - 9:00 PM  🏟️ VENUE: Megalomaniac Winery (3930 Cherry Avenue, Vineland, ON)  💵 PRICE:  $49 + HST (Early Bird: $39 + HST)     To donate and help support the festival:    * Please note that donations accepted to help the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!        ABOUT THE SHOW  CELEBRATING GREAT CANADIAN FEMALES in JAZZ featuring   LAILA BIALI  Sunday, July 30th, 2017  4:30pm - 6pm  7pm - 9pm  MEGALOMANIAC WINERY -  3930 Cherry Avenue, Vineland, ON  &nbsp;    $49 + HST / Early Bird: $39 + HST (Until April 30th, 2017)  Weekend Pass (Includes ALL Festival events):  $249 + HST    ***All artists and venues subject to change. *** * Supported in part by the Ontario 150 Fund (Province of Ontario) and the City of St. Catharines. *"
