      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "FEATURING:  Lesley Mitchell-Clarke &amp; Ashley St. Pierre     EVENT: Twilight Jazz Series: Niagara-on-the-Lake edition – Queens on Queen with  DATE: Sunday, March 17, 2019  TIME: 6 PM – 9 PM  LOCATION: Cork’s Playhouse Theatre  ADDRESS: 19 Queen St., Niagara-on-the-Lake, ON  TICKET PRICE: $15 in advance /$20 at the door / $10+ HST Musicians &amp; Arts Workers / $8 students      *All tickets are subject to 13% HST and handling fees        &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    ABOUT THE SHOW    Lesley Mitchell-Clarke:  Vocals  Ashley St. Pierre:  Vocals  Tom Szczesniak:  Piano  Steve Lucas:  Bass        CLICK HERE for Lesley's artist page        &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    &nbsp;    CLICK HERE for Ashley's artist page"
      }
