      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "DATE:             Friday June 26, 2020  TIME:              7:00 pm – 8:00 pm EDST  VENUE:          'LIVEstream.LOVE.JAZZ.Series' (This event will be Live streamed)  PRICE:            FREE (Donations accepted)    * Please note that donations accepted to help the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!  [embed]https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aDsU59I4SHI[/embed]  To tip the band:    To donate and help support the festival:          ABOUT AMANDA:    Amanda Tosoff is a B.C-raised Toronto-based pianist, composer, and educator with five albums to her credit. She has performed with such internationally recognized artists as Emilie-Claire Barlow, Ingrid Jensen and Christine Jensen, Phil Dwyer, and many more. Amanda has also opened for jazz luminaries Bobby Hutcherson, Renee Rosnes, Oliver Jones, and renowned Brazilian singer Luciana Souza; and she has received such awards as the Montréal Jazz Festival Grand Prix de Jazz, and the 2016 Toronto Arts Foundation Emerging Jazz Artist Award.  This fall, Amanda will release a new recording, Earth Voices, which features special guest vocalists Emilie-Claire Barlow, Laila Biali, Lydia Persaud, Michelle Willis, Felicity Williams, Alex Samaras, and Robin Dann, as well as instrumentalists Kelly Jefferson, Allison Au, and Alex Goodman, Jon Maharaj and Morgan Childs  Visit www.amandatosoff.com for information about upcoming releases and educational events.  &nbsp;            ABOUT THE “LIVEStream.LOVE.JAZZ.Series&quot;    “We love organically grown events and this series is a prime example of that. In January of 2019, we started a series called &quot;IN YOUR OWN BACKYARD&quot; when local jazz pianist Doug Mundy asked us if we could store his Steinway grand piano at our Shady Acres Studio. We knew how our jazz fans LOVE the intimate concerts so we thought why not do one ‘In our own back yard’.    The first 4-part piano series was a huge success so we then decided to add another 4 shows and then another 2! 10 shows in total for 2019 and when the piano was removed we decided to continue with a guitar series. Part 4 of the guitar series came during the COVID-19 pandemic so we decided to adapt to the times. Our NEW live-streamed events are now in YOUR own backyard.  ‘From our back yard to yours’    To align with our tag line:  LIVE LOVE JAZZ and the current situation, we have re-branded our series to be called the “LIVEStream.LOVE.JAZZ.Series&quot;.    We do look forward to having our guests gather in our backyard again soon (when it is safe to do so) but until then we are thrilled to be able to live-stream our events and to keep the music alive in Niagara and beyond”    Juliet Dunn and Peter Shea (Co-creators: Twilight Jazz Series and TD Niagara Jazz Festival)    Find us online : www.NiagaraJazzFestival.com  Call us at: 1-844-LIV-JAZZ (1-844-548-5299)  Thank you to our generous sponsors for their donations:  [rev_slider alias=&quot;llj-sponsors&quot;]"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "LIVEstream.LOVE.JAZZ Series #29 with Amanda Tosoff"
      }
