    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The 2019 TD Niagara Jazz Festival joins forces with Vieni Estates and the Town of Lincoln to present the 2nd annual Vieni Estates SPARKLE FEST. Enjoy a lazy Sunday under the sun up on the Bench in Beamsville and celebrate live music, food, wine, bubbles and more!    DATE:  Sunday, June 23rd, 2019  TIME:  11am – 6pm  VENUE: Vieni Estates  ADDRESS:   4553 Fly Rd, Beamsville, ON  PRICE: FREE      *Bring your LAWN CHAIR  *RAIN or SHINE event (We have tents!)         The TD Niagara Jazz Festival will provide the music featuring their ‘Jazz 4 the Ages’ Youth Finalists and previous winners and finalists.    CONGRATULATIONS to all of our  2018 ‘Jazz 4 the Ages’ Youth Finalists:    4 Beats Behind, Agneya Chikte Quartet, Avery Cantello Band, Brian Dowd, Carolina Marhue, Chloe Rabideau, Cynthia Fay, Dawson Chamberlain, Disciples of Mountain, Elizabeth Pereira, Evan Dim, Joel Lewczynski, Matt Lagan, Michael Morabito, Sydney Bergevin.    CLICK HERE  for ALL photos and bios          2019 SCHEDULE          Time  Performer/Presenter      11:00:00 AM  Opening Remarks / Vieni &amp; TD NJF      11:15:00 AM  Peter Shea Duo (Instrumental jazz)      12:00:00 PM  Opening Remarks / Town of Lincoln      12:05:00 PM  Finalist Performance TBA      12:25:00 PM  Finalist Performance TBA      12:50:00 PM  Finalist Performance TBA      1:10:00 PM  Finalist Performance TBA      1:30:00 PM  Finalist Performance TBA      1:50:00 PM  Previous winner's performance      2:20:00 PM  Finalist Performance TBA      2:50:00 PM  Finalist Performance TBA      3:20:00 PM  Finalist Performance TBA      3:40:00 PM  Finalist Performance TBA      4:00:00 PM  Finalist Performance TBA      4:20:00 PM  Finalist Performance TBA      4:40:00 PM   Previous winner's performance      5:00:00 PM  Certificate and prizes presentation / Winners announced      6:00:00 PM  End of event        &nbsp;        &nbsp;  VENDORS           * Performance times are subject to change.  * Thanks to the Town of Lincoln for their generous support!  * All finalists receive cash honorariums."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Vieni Estates SPARKLE FEST"
      }
    ],
