    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Niagara's Summer Mardi Gras (2nd Annual)  Saturday, July 18, 2020  Port Dalhousie     Join us in beautiful Niagara as we celebrate our 2nd Annual Summer MARDI GRAS.  Featuring a Selection of New Orleans Style Bands (Artist Line-Up Coming Soon)     This fun-filled event transforms Port Dalhousie into 'New Orleans of the North!’ Enjoy a street parade, all day live music, Cajun and Creole-inspired food, magic and Voodoo and lots of fun activities!     Mask Making Workshop (This popular event is returning in 2020 - Date TBA)  Cajun cooking demo with Chef Greg Willis of KitchenMade (limited space available)       EARLY BIRD TICKETS AND PRICING AVAILABLE NOW  Click Here for Tickets     BOURBON STREET  $29 FOR LOCAL NIAGARA RESIDENTS*    $19 Early Bird Price  *Discounted price – Must show ID at the door with proof of address  Includes Summer Mardi Gras concerts at Niagara resident special pricing  &nbsp;  BASIN STREET  $39 FOR VIP TICKETS   $29 Early Bird Price  Includes Summer Mardi Gras concerts and access to lower VIP Bar    &nbsp;  FRENCHMEN STREET - VIENI SPARKLE ZONE  $59 FOR VIENI SPARKLE ZONE   $49 Early Bird Price  Limited seats available. Ticket includes:        Front row seating for Summer Mardi Gras music stage    Two $5 food coupons    One bottle of Vieni Momenti (per couple) or 2 drink tokens    Access to lower VIP Bar            Coming in December:       CANAL STREET  Pricing and Menu TBA – Coming Soon!  Limited seats available. Ticket includes:        VIP PASS and VIP Front Row seating for Summer Mardi Gras music stage    Cajun-style dinner prepared by Niagara Chef Erik Peacock of Wellington Court (menu coming soon)    Access to lower VIP Bar         WEEKEND PACKAGE PRICING  If you're from out of town, why not make a weekend of it?     Contact us for information on our weekend package pricing.   Packages vary and include:        One or two-night stay in Niagara    JAZZ in the City at Mahtay Café and Lounge Tickets (Fri, July 17)    After Party at White Oaks Resort and Spa - PLAY (Fri, July 17)    Niagara's Summer MARDI GRAS Tickets (Sat, July 18)    VIP Status at WORLD MUSIC on the BEACH in Lakeside Park (Sun, July 19)    After Party (Location TBA) (Sun, July 19)    Winery and brewery tastings  "
      }
    ],
