    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "    Twilight Jazz Series - St. Catharines Edition    Presented by DPLU Music, Mahtay Café &amp; Lounge &amp; the TD Niagara Jazz Festival the Twilight Jazz Series is a monthly jazz series that takes place the first Sunday of every month from November to June in St. Catharines.    Featuring: Caribbean Club Trio  Bio coming soon...  Go to www.twilightjazz.ca for more info."
      }
