        "@id": "https://niagarajazzfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Merchandise-placeholder.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://niagarajazzfestival.com/events/live-learn-jazz-dames-in-the-distillery/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://niagarajazzfestival.com/artists/june-garber/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "📅 DATE: Thursday, May 11, 2017  🕑 TIME: 7:00 PM  🏟️ VENUE: Wayne Gretzky Distillery (219 Niagara Stone Road, NOTL, ON)  💵 PRICE:  $25 + HST (Early Bird: $20 + HST)     To donate and help support the festival:    * Please note that donations accepted to help the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!        ABOUT THE SHOW  DAMES IN THE DISTILLERY featuring   HEATHER BAMBRICK and JUNE GARBER  Lyrics tell the story and the human voice connects us all to the music.  The voice is the first instrument and storytelling wrapped in melody is a perfect combination.  Jazz has a long tradition of incredible female vocalists ranging from Sarah Vaughan to Diana Krall.   These ‘Dames’ are sure to distil your senses in more ways than one.    ***All artists and venues subject to change. *** * Supported in part by the Ontario 150 Fund (Province of Ontario) and the City of St. Catharines. *"
      }
    ],
