    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "DATE:             Sunday, December 20, 2020  TIME:              11:30 am – 7:30 pm EST  VENUE:          This event will be Livestreamed  PRICE:            FREE (Donations accepted)              To donate and help support the festival:    Donations to the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) help us continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!        ABOUT CONNECTED WORLD:  A Winter World Music Celebration  Join us online on Sunday, December 20, 2020 beginning at 11:30 am for a full-day lineup of World Music performances, interactive workshops, food &amp; beverage demonstrations, dance-alongs, sing-alongs, and fun for the whole family!  FEATURED ARTISTS      Crystal D’Cunha (Emcee)      Neema Children's Choir (Uganda)  Hamsa Hamsa (Spain/Middle East)    Valérie Ekoumé (France/Cameroun)  Guy Nwongang (France/Cameroun)  PK Hummingbird Steel Orchestra (Niagara/Trinidad)    Amanda Martinez (Toronto/Mexico/South Africa)      Itamar Erez (Vancouver/Israel)             Amir Amiri        &nbsp;  "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "CONNECTED WORLD: A Winter World Music Celebration&#8230; Virtually!"
      }
