      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "📅 DATE: Sunday, July 24, 2022  🕑 TIME: 10:30 am – 8:30 pm  🏟️ VENUE: Club LaSalle / Sunset Beach  🗺️ ADDRESS: 111 Arthur St, St. Catharines, ON L2M 1H8  💵 PRICE: FREE  📝 NOTES: Bring Your Own Chair (BYOC) - Weekend &amp; VIP Summer Pass holders will have reserved seats available    ARTISTSHEALTH AND SAFETY2022 SUMMER FESTIVALVENDORS  Artists from left (clockwise:  Le Trio Parisien feat Juliet Dunn, Phil Davis, Shine Roc and the Rebels Vibration Band, Pulkes  Band, Crystal D'Cunha (Host Emcee), Nemesis feat Scott Jackson &amp; Dr Draw, PK Hummingbird Steel Orchestra, Johannes Linstead, Miguel De Armas  Food, Artisan Vendors and fun for the whole family! Bring your own lawn chair!  We are still looking for vendors and artisans! Register by CLICKING HERE  Hosted by Club LaSalle          ABOUT THE SHOW  This summer we are thrilled to see the return of WORLD MUSIC on the BEACH! Join us for a full day of live music featuring World Music Artists from around the globe along with diverse food options, artisan vendors and our community partners!    WEEKEND &amp; VIP SUMMER PASS HOLDERS - We will have reserved VIP seating for you on site.    Please visit our Health and Safety page for updates on our current guidelines.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com.    &nbsp;  SCHEDULE  [table id=34 /]        ABOUT THE ARTISTS:          PULKES      NEMESIS      SHINE ROC AND THE REBELS VIBRATION          MIGUEL DE ARMAS      JOHANNES LINSTEAD      LE TRIO PARISIEN FT. JULIET DUNN          PK HUMMINGBIRD STEEL ORCHESTRA      SAMBA SQUAD            &nbsp;      To donate and help support the festival:    Donations to the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) help us continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "WORLD MUSIC on the BEACH 2022 Featuring Various WORLD MUSIC Artists"
      }
