    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "WORLD MUSIC on the BEACH     Date:  Sunday, July 21, 2019  Time:  11 am – 10 pm ('Active Zone' starts at 9 am)  Venue:  Rennie Park  Address: 60 Lakeport Rd, St. Catharines, ON L2N 4P5  Price:  FREE EVENT - Don't forget to bring your lawn chairs!    *Full schedule coming soon!    Looking for accommodations? CLICK HERE    Various WORLD MUSIC Artists Include: Mdou Moctar, Sultans of String, Neema Children's Choir, Hummingbird Steel Band, Miguel de Armas, Los Hijos de Tuta and more...            Mdou Moctar (Niger)        Neema Children's Choir (Uganda)                Lots of fun for the whole family!    Last year's WORLD MUSIC on the BEACH artists:      Looking to Book a Hotel?  The TD Niagara Jazz Festival is providing you with hotels and Airbnbs at the lowest prices available online. Book your stay directly through the map below! For your convenience, our hotel partner, White Oaks Resort and Spa, is highlighted in green.    NOTE: If the hotel your looking for does not have vacancy for your selected dates, it will not show up on the map.         document.addEventListener(&quot;DOMContentLoaded&quot;, function(e) {      // 1. Edit widget size      var settings22 = {        width: '100%', // set the width in px or %        height: '460px' // set the height in px or %      };      // 2. Fill out your config here and the rest should work      var s22obj = {        aid: 'niagarajazzfestival', // your affiliate id for tracking        address: '60 Lakeport Rd., St. Catharines, ON' , // Lat/Lng or full street address. For latlng use the &quot;lat&quot;:,&quot;lng&quot;: keys instead        checkin: '2019-07-21', //        maincolor: 'FFFFFF', // your main brand color in hex (without the #)        fontcolor: '50B948', // The navbar's font color in hex (without the #)        featuredhcids: '1109445', // Comma seperated list of HotelsCombined IDs to stand out from other hotels          chpincolor: '50b948', // If you have custom hotels, in hex (without the #)        navimage: 'https://niagarajazzfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/NJF-2018-logo.png', // If set, provide an absolute full URL to change the main logo in the navbar (button on the far left) image        markerimage: 'https://niagarajazzfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/NJF-2018-logo.png', // If set, provide an absolute full URL to change the marker (main map pin) image         zoom: '12',         disableautohover: true      };      // Leave this part intact      var params22=''; for (var key in s22obj){if (params22){params22 +='&amp;';}params22 +=key + '=' + encodeURIComponent(s22obj[key]);}var div22=document.getElementById('stay22-script'); div22.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend', '');    });      "
      }
