      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "📅 DATE: Friday, July 27th, 2018  🕑 TIME: 7:30 PM – 11:00 PM  🏟️ VENUE: FirstOntario Performing Arts Centre – Partridge Hall (250 St. Paul St., St. Catharines, ON)  💵 PRICE:  $59 + HST ($49 + HST until April 5th, 2018)    To donate and help support the festival:    * Please note that donations accepted to help the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!        ABOUT THE SHOW  This is a show not to be missed…    Jim John’s Swing Shift Big Band from Toronto teams up with vocalist Christopher Alan Graves from North Carolina for an unforgettable concert of Big Band Jazz featuring classics from the greats:  Frank Sinatra, Dean Martin, Nat King Cole, Sammy Davis Jr and many more.  And guest vocalist Heather Bambrick (Jazz.FM 91.1) will be sure to delight you with her world class vocals and divine wit!    Dinner and show packages available HERE.  OPENING ACTS:  Carolina Marhue ‘JAZZ 4 THE AGES’ Winner  Michael Morabito ‘JAZZ 4 THE AGES’ Winner   BIG BAND JAZZ:  Jim John’s Swing Shift Big Band featuring Christopher Alan Graves"
      }
    ],
