    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "📅 DATE: Saturday, July 22, 2023  🕑 TIME: 8:00 pm – 12:00 am   🏟️ VENUE: The Irish Harp Pub  🗺️ ADDRESS: 245 King St, Niagara-on-the-Lake, ON  💵 PRICE (Ticket): FREE  💵 PRICE (Summer Pass): $269 + HST  🥗 FOOD: Available on site        BUY SUMMER PASSVIEW ALL SHOWS                              ABOUT THE SHOW:  Jazz Jams are an essential part of any major jazz or music festival. Festivals unite players from all over the Globe and once they’re in town they just wanna play! On, Saturday, July 22 the Randy Stirtzinger trio will be the TD NJF house trio leading the jam session and they will be eagerly awaiting musicians and singers to come and sit in. First come, first serve.        ABOUT THE ARTISTS:  Featuring the Randy Stirtzinger Trio (TD NJF House Band) &amp; Special guests    Randy will be joined by:      Rob McBride on Bass    Kevin Lipishak on Drums          PLEASE NOTE:      Physical/digital tickets are not issued for this show. Admission is tracked through the order placed and will be added to the event’s guest list. Please retain your Order Confirmation email in case proof of purchase is required.    Tickets are non-refundable. Artists and venues are subject to change. Please visit our Health and Safety page for updates on our current guidelines.    Artists and venues subject to change.    This event will take place rain or shine.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com.          &nbsp;  SPONSORED AND HOSTED BY THE IRISH HARP PUB        To donate and help support the festival:    Donations to the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) help us continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!          BUY SUMMER PASSVIEW ALL SHOWS  &nbsp;  Supported in part by:  "
      }
