    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "📅 DATE: Thursday, July 6, 2017  🕑 TIME: 7:00 PM  🏟️ VENUE: Stratus Vineyards (2059 Niagara Stone Road, NOTL ON)  💵 PRICE:  $25 + HST (Early Bird: $20 + HST)     To donate and help support the festival:    * Please note that donations accepted to help the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!        ABOUT THE SHOW  VIBES IN THE VINES featuring   RANDY STIRTZINGER and GRAHAM LEAR  Thursday, July 6th, 2017  7pm - 9pm  STRATUS VINEYARDS -  2059 Niagara Stone Road, NOTL, ON  From Lionel Hampton to Cal Tjader and Gary Burton, Milt Jackson to Canada’s very own Peter Appleyard there is a longstanding and incredible tradition behind this unique &amp; beautiful instrument. Some of the finest practitioners dwell in our own backyard! Come out and see Niagara’s very own Randy Stirtzinger on of this iconic instrument with legendary drummer Graham Lear!  (Santana, Paul Anka, Gino Vanelli)  You’ll really dig the vibes in the vines!    $25 + HST / Early Bird: $20 + HST (Until April 30th, 2017)  Weekend Pass (Includes ALL Festival events):  $249 + HST    ***All artists and venues subject to change. *** * Supported in part by the Ontario 150 Fund (Province of Ontario) and the City of St. Catharines. *"
      }
    ],
