    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "JAZZ in the PARK FEATURING VARIOUS ARTISTS     Date:  Saturday, July 27, 2019  Time: 11am - 7:00 pm  Venue:  Simcoe Park  Address: Picton St, Niagara-on-the-Lake, ON L0S 1J0  CLICK HERE for Town of NOTL Website  Price:  FREE EVENT - Don't forget to bring your lawn chairs!    Various JAZZ in the PARK Artists include:  Alex Pangman, Graham Lear, Betsy Tauro, Los Hijos de Tuta, SWA Salsa Band, Nick Mclean, Bradley Krauss and more...    ABOUT JAZZ in the PARK    Co-created by Niagara Jazz artists Juliet Dunn and Peter Shea, The TD Niagara Jazz Festival is now entering it’s 6th year.  The TD NJF is an exciting new Jazz Festival dedicated to celebrating the art form of jazz in the Niagara Region. We inspire, educate and develop future jazz audiences while combining live jazz with a Niagara experience – food, wine, culture and natural wonders.    Jazz in the Park features 3 musical stages, close to 20 bands and performances, an instrument petting zoo (for all ages), Jazzoo!  (a petting zoo for kids), a kids zone, artisan vendors, food vendors, wine and craft beer.  FREE for the community and be sure to bring a lawn chair!    SCHEDULE      DANCE LESSONS  We are pleased to offer FREE Swing and Latin dance lessons from Niagara Lindy Hop and Dance Fit Niagara throughout the day. Click HERE to learn more!  Looking to Book a Hotel?  The TD Niagara Jazz Festival is providing you with hotels and Airbnbs at the lowest prices available online. Book your stay directly through the map below! For your convenience, our hotel partner, White Oaks Resort and Spa, is highlighted in green.    NOTE: If the hotel your looking for does not have vacancy for your selected dates, it will not show up on the map.           document.addEventListener(&quot;DOMContentLoaded&quot;, function(e) {      // 1. Edit widget size      var settings22 = {        width: '100%', // set the width in px or %        height: '460px' // set the height in px or %      };      // 2. Fill out your config here and the rest should work      var s22obj = {        aid: 'niagarajazzfestival', // your affiliate id for tracking        address: 'Simcoe Park, Niagara-on-the-Lake, ON' , // Lat/Lng or full street address. For latlng use the &quot;lat&quot;:,&quot;lng&quot;: keys instead        checkin: '2019-07-27', //        maincolor: 'FFFFFF', // your main brand color in hex (without the #)        fontcolor: '50B948', // The navbar's font color in hex (without the #)        featuredhcids: '1109445', // Comma seperated list of HotelsCombined IDs to stand out from other hotels          chpincolor: '50b948', // If you have custom hotels, in hex (without the #)        navimage: 'https://niagarajazzfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/NJF-2018-logo.png', // If set, provide an absolute full URL to change the main logo in the navbar (button on the far left) image        markerimage: 'https://niagarajazzfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/NJF-2018-logo.png', // If set, provide an absolute full URL to change the marker (main map pin) image         zoom: '11',         disableautohover: true      };      // Leave this part intact      var params22=''; for (var key in s22obj){if (params22){params22 +='&amp;';}params22 +=key + '=' + encodeURIComponent(s22obj[key]);}var div22=document.getElementById('stay22-script'); div22.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend', '');    });  "
      }
    ],
