    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "📅 DATE: Saturday, July 25, 2015  🕑 TIME: 6:00 PM to 12:30 AM  🏟️ VENUE: Market Square (St. Catharines, ON)  💵 PRICE: $20 or $25 Club Pass for all Club Series events    To donate and help support the festival:    Donations to the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) help us continue to bring live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!        ABOUT THE SHOW  A ‘POP-UP’ JAZZ CLUB IN THE HEART OF DOWNTOWN ST. CATHARINES.        6:00PM – 6:30PM  Frank’s Bus Brass Band      7:00PM – 7:45PM  Ori Dagan Trio      8:15PM – 9:00PM  Barbra Lica Trio      9:30 PM – 11:00PM  Robi Botos Quartet      11:30PM – 12:30 AM  Heilig Manouvre        This event is a must see! Some of Canada’s finest jazz musicians all under one roof. This ‘pop-up’ jazz stage will feature a Steinway grand piano for a one of a kind event.        Tickets are $20 at the door but with a $25 Club Series pass you have access to this stage and ALL Club Series events! Book yours now!    For anyone unfamiliar with Market Square, it’s an indoor space that will be converted into a popup jazz club.    CLICK HERE for a list of all the Club Series Events."
      }
