    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://niagarajazzfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Merchandise-placeholder.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://niagarajazzfestival.com/events/jazz-on-the-rise/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://niagarajazzfestival.com/artists/a-l-artists/john-sherwood/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The TD Niagara Jazz Festival is proud to partner with Megalomaniac Winery to bring Jazz on the Rise to the last day of the festival weekend on Sunday, July 30th.    This event will include a FREE STAGE, food vendors, Megalomaniac Wines, Mill St. Beer, and artisan vendors.  The Grand Finale stage is a celebration of Canada's 150 with 3 ticketed events all performed on a majestic Steinway piano.    Tickets are going fast to these events so be sure to reserve yours in advance!    Details and tickets below.    * A shuttle will be available on Megalomaniac's property, so let the TD NJF Volunteers help you park down the hill and get a ride to the top!  And please drink responsibly. *        *** PLEASE NOTE:  This is an ADULT ONLY event.  For the FAMILY FRIENDLY 'Jazz in the Park' event CLICK HERE ***  ___________________________________________________________________________    FREE Stage:  [caption id=&quot;attachment_9986&quot; align=&quot;aligncenter&quot; width=&quot;644&quot;] From left to right: Turbo Street Funk, Juliann Kuchocki, Stu MacDonald Quartet[/caption]    11:00am – Opening Remarks  11:15am – 11:45am – Jazz for the Ages Youth Winners (TBC)  11:45am – 12:45pm – Turbo Street Funk  1:15pm – 2pm – Juliann Kuchocki &amp; Dave Restivo Duo  3:30pm – 4:30pm – Stu MacDonald Quartet  6pm – 7pm – Hammerton, Wagler, O'Neill Trio  ________________________________________________________________________________    LIVE LEARN JAZZ: A Canadiana Suite Stage  12:45pm – 1:15pm – Sophia Perlman Duo  2pm - Celebrating Moe Koffman  Featuring: Bernie Senensky's Moe Koffman Legacy Band with Bill McBirnie - $39 + HST        [caption id=&quot;attachment_9988&quot; align=&quot;aligncenter&quot; width=&quot;621&quot;] From left to right: Bernie Senensky, Moe Koffman, Bill McBirnie[/caption]    ________________________________________________________________________________  4:30pm - Celebrating Great Canadian Females in Jazz  Opening act: Ashley St. Pierre Trio  Featuring: Laila Biali - $49 + HST      [caption id=&quot;attachment_9989&quot; align=&quot;aligncenter&quot; width=&quot;644&quot;]  Ashley St. Pierre and Laila Biali[/caption]  _____________________________________________________________________________  7pm - Celebrating Oscar Peterson    Featuring: The John Sherwood Trio: John Sherwood, Dave Young* and Terry Clarke* $59 + HST    ________________________________________________________________________________    TD Niagara Jazz Festival VIP MEGALOMANIAC VIP PATIO      An incredible view of the Niagara Region and beyond.  This patio is reserved for VIP's only.  Become a festival VIP by booking your weekend pass today!          &nbsp;         "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Jazz on the Rise"
      }
    ],
