    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "DATE:  Thursday, July 5th, 2018  EVENT: SAX in the VINEYARD featuring Bobby Militello  STAGE: Henry of Pelham Winery  ADDRESS: Pelham Road, St. Catharines, ON  TIME: 7pm –  9:30pm  TICKET PRICE: $59 + HST (Students:  $30 + HST)    Get your tickets today, this show is ALMOST SOLD OUT!  [cs_gb id=12373]  *Ticket price includes one glass of Henry of Pelham wine and a light snack.  *Please note that there is no restaurant serving on site. Dining before the show is recommended.  Click HERE to see our restaurant partners.        Bobby Militello  One of our greatest saxophone legends “Pat LaBarbera” performed this event to a sold out audience at Henry Of Pelham winery last year and this is a favourite event amongst TD Niagara Jazz Festival fans.    This year we have the distinct privilege to present another living saxophone legend who lives just south of our border: Bobby Militello!    To have played a mere few gigs with Dave Brubeck would be impressive on its own. This gentleman performed, recorded and toured with the late great jazz legend for over 30 years! Dave Brubeck is well known even by non-jazz musicians and enthusiast for his famous compositions “Take Five” “Unsquare Dance” “Blue Rondo a la Turk” to name few, and all of them in odd time signatures! We invite you to come and experience this incredible rendition of the music of Dave Brubeck in the stunning vineyard at Henry of Pelham Winery!  Opening Act:  Local saxophonist Glendon Smith will open the show with John Sherwood on piano, Steve Lucas on bass and Kevin Lipishak on drums.      Glendon Smith"
      }
    ],
