        "@value": "DATE:             Saturday, August 29, 2020  TIME:              4:00 pm – 9:00 pm EDT  VENUE:          To Be Announced Soon!  PRICE:            FREE (Donations Accepted)    Your donations help the TD Niagara Jazz Festival (Registered Charity: #80107-7033-RR0001) to continue delivering live music to Niagara and beyond. Thank you for supporting the arts!    &nbsp;                      ABOUT OUR JAZZ 4 THE AGES YOUTH COMPETITION:  More information coming soon.            Visit Learn about JAZZ 4 the AGES: wwwniagarajazzfestival.com/jazz-4-the-ages-youth-contest    &nbsp;                  Watch Livestream on Facebook          Watch Livestream on YouTube                    Our thanks to the City of St. Catharines  for their generous support!                    "
