    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅 DATES: Mondays, April 6, May 4 and June 1  🕑 TIME: 7 pm – 9:30 pm  🏟️ VENUE: The Hare Wine Co.    🗺️ ADDRESS:  769 Niagara Stone Road, Niagara-on-the-Lake  💵 PRICE (REGULAR): $99 + HST + FEES (for all 3 shows! - Savings of $18)  🍕 FOOD: Snack foods available on site.   🍷 DRINKS: Cash bar on site  🚗  PARKING: Free on site     *Doors at 6 pm / Concert starts at 7 pm               SHOW INFO  (click on date to see full show info)  April 6 - Cuban Jazz Night - Miguel de Armas Trio  May 4 - Trio Explorations - Nancy Walker Trio   June 1 -  Get Hooked! - Dizzy and Fay  The Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues Series continues with three captivating evenings of live music, each showcasing a unique sound and style. Experience the vibrant rhythms of Cuban Jazz Night with the Miguel de Armas Trio, an electrifying performance filled with Latin flair and improvisational brilliance. Next, enjoy Trio Explorations with the Nancy Walker Trio, where inventive arrangements and dynamic interplay bring fresh life to jazz classics and originals. Rounding out the series with Dizzy and Fay, featuring Mark Lalama and Amanda Walther, who blend elegant piano with luminous vocals to create a warm and intimate jazz-inspired sound. Their performances weave together original songs and beautifully reimagined classics, delivered with rich musicality and heartfelt storytelling. 🎶  Please note:  all series pass holders have reserved seating!   Doors at 6 pm / Concerts starts at 7 pm                 BUY SERIES PASSES                      ABOUT THE TWILIGHT JAZZ &amp; BLUES SERIES  🎶 Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues Series 🎶  About the Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues Series  Now in it's 15th year, the Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues Series offers intimate, evening performances that celebrate the soul of jazz and blues in atmospheric venues across the region. Featuring outstanding local and international artists, the series blends timeless standards, contemporary sounds, and unforgettable collaborations.  The Twilight Jazz &amp; Blues Series invites audiences to experience world-class music up close in the warm glow of Niagara evenings at one of Niagara's premier wineries: The Hare Wine Co.  BUY SERIES PASSES                                  Presented by    Juliet Amanda Dunn Entertainment                     In partnership with                                                                          BUY SERIES PASSES                          PLEASE NOTE:      Tickets are non-refundable.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com                        "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Twilight Jazz &#038; Blues Series &#8211; 3 show PASSES"
      }
    ],
