    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅DATE: Sunday, April 19, 2026  🕑TIME: 7 pm – 9 pm (Dining from 5 pm)  🏟️VENUE: SECRET Pop-Up Location (Revealed upon ticket purchase)  🗺️ADDRESS: TBC   💵PRICE (REGULAR): $33 + HST + FEES  💵DISCOUNT (Promo Code - MAWSU-2026):  - 50% ($16.50) + HST + FEES  (Musicians/Arts Workers/Students/Under 30)  💵SERIES PASS PRICE (3 Shows: Apr 19 / Ma7 17 / June 14): $79 + HST + FEES  🧀 FOOD: Restaurant on site   🍷DRINKS: Wine, Beer &amp; non-alcoholic options   🚗 PARKING: Street parking on site    *Doors at 6 pm / Concert starts at 7 pm                ABOUT JULIET DUNN'S SECRET SALON SERIES         Experience live music like never before. Curated by vocalist and producer and Niagara Jazz Festival co-creator and Executive and Artistic Director, Juliet Dunn, the Secret Salon Series brings intimate performances to unique, undisclosed venues across Niagara — revealed only days before the show.  Expect world-class musicians, cozy vibes, and unforgettable nights of jazz, soul, and discovery.  Limited tickets. Secret location. Pure magic!   Where music meets mystery.                BUY TICKETS    BUY a SERIES PASS            ABOUT THE SHOW          🎶 ROOTED in SOUL 🎶      Join Mel Monaco, accompanied by Brent Setterington and George Agustus, for a soulful journey through original songs and modernized timeless classics at Juliet Dunn’s Secret Salon Series this April 2026.  In honor of Earth Day, every guest will receive a special token connecting music and nature. Experience the earthy, heartfelt grooves of Jazz, Blues, and Soul—Rooted in Soul is music that moves both spirit and earth.                    ABOUT THE ARTISTS      Mel Monaco is a captivating Niagara-based vocalist known for her warm tone, expressive phrasing, and engaging stage presence. Drawing from jazz, soul, and classic pop influences, she brings both elegance and emotional depth to her performances. Whether interpreting beloved standards or contemporary songs, Mel creates a rich musical experience that connects effortlessly with audiences.                                      BUY TICKETS    BUY a SERIES PASS                              Presented byJ    J.A.D.E. Niagara  (Juliet Amanda Dunn Entertainment)                     In partnership with          In partnership with:  SECRET VENUE! TBA   (Or when you purchase your ticket)                        BUY TICKETS    BUY a SERIES PASS                                PLEASE NOTE:      Tickets are non-refundable.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com                        "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
