    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  📅DATE: Monday, May 4th, 2026  🕑TIME: 7 pm – 9:30 pm  🏟️VENUE: The Hare Wine Co.  🗺️ADDRESS: 789 Niagara Stone Road, Niagara-on-the-Lake, ON  💵PRICE (REGULAR): $39 + HST + FEES  💵DISCOUNT (Promo Code - MAWSU-2026): -50% (19.50) + HST + FEES   (Musicians/Arts Workers/Students/Under 30)  🍕 FOOD: Snack foods available on site.   🍷DRINKS: Wine by the glass available  🚗 PARKING: Free on site     *Doors at 6 pm / Concert starts at 7 pm                 BUY TICKETS          BUY a SERIES PASS      ABOUT THE SHOW          🎶 TRIO EXPLORATIONS 🎶      Pianist Nancy Walker and her trio perform music from her 2026 JUNO-nominated album ‘Deeper Down’, and take a deep dive into favourites from the standard jazz repertoire.  Nancy Walker:  Piano  TBC:  Bass  TBC:  Drums        &nbsp;                ABOUT THE ARTISTS      About the artists    Nancy Walker is a highly respected Canadian jazz pianist, composer, and arranger known for her lyrical playing and sophisticated harmonic style. A longtime member of the Canadian jazz community, she has performed and recorded with many of the country’s leading musicians and has been featured at major jazz festivals and venues. Walker is also an accomplished educator and bandleader, admired for her expressive touch at the piano and her ability to blend classic jazz traditions with modern influences.                                  BUY TICKETS          BUY a SERIES PASS                              Presented by    Juliet Amanda Dunn Entertainment                     In partnership with          Sponsored by:                          BUY TICKETS          BUY a SERIES PASS                                        PLEASE NOTE:      Tickets are non-refundable.    For more details, please email Darlene at admin@niagarajazzfestival.com                        "
      }
    ],
